<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:10.000" end="00:00:15.600" style="s2">Wow, so this is my deadbeat dad company.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.800" end="00:00:17.500" style="s2">So big, so pretty. He must be super</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.600" end="00:00:19.800" style="s2">rich. I definitely came to the right</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.500" end="00:00:20.700" style="s2">place. My formula money is finally</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.800" end="00:00:22.800" style="s2">sorted.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.700" end="00:00:24.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey there, why are you here all alone?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.800" end="00:00:27.600" style="s2">Where are your mom and dad?</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.000" end="00:00:29.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, is this Grant Beckett&#39;s company?</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.600" end="00:00:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, this is the Beckett group. Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.600" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">Beckett is our CEO.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.800" end="00:00:35.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this is the place. I have real</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.700" end="00:00:37.100" style="s2">business with him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.200" end="00:00:38.500" style="s2">Grant Beckett, come out. Don&#39;t hide in</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.100" end="00:00:40.300" style="s2">there and stay quiet. I know you&#39;re in</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.500" end="00:00:42.200" style="s2">the office. You had the guts to know my</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.300" end="00:00:44.100" style="s2">mom, so pay back the money.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.200" end="00:00:45.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid, don&#39;t shout nonsense. Mr. Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.100" end="00:00:45.500" style="s2">isn&#39;t even married. How could he have a</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.100" end="00:00:47.300" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:49.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not making it up. Grant Beckett is</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.300" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">my dad. And he still hasn&#39;t paid my</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.400" end="00:00:51.200" style="s2">formula money. I&#39;m here to collect the</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:52.500" style="s2">debt.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.200" end="00:00:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I hear right? A kid asking Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.500" end="00:00:55.500" style="s2">Beckett for formula money? Who is this</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.600" end="00:00:57.800" style="s2">kid anyway? Could she be Mr. Beckett&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.500" end="00:00:59.800" style="s2">secret love child? This is big news. Hey</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.800" end="00:01:01.000" style="s2">kiddo, come with me. We&#39;ll help you find</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.800" end="00:01:03.400" style="s2">your parents.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.000" end="00:01:04.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m looking for Grant. Stay back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.400" end="00:01:08.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me help you find him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.500" end="00:01:11.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t trust you. Don&#39;t try to grab me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.300" end="00:01:11.500" style="s2">I&#39;m not stupid.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:18.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, who brought their kid to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.300" end="00:01:18.500" style="s2">office? The little girl&#39;s pretty</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.800" end="00:01:23.100" style="s2">Hey, that&#39;s the CEO&#39;s private elevator.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.700" end="00:01:25.900" style="s2">Get out. Hey kid, stop right there.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.100" end="00:01:27.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bye-bye security guy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.900" end="00:01:29.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re done for. That kid went all the</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.500" end="00:01:32.700" style="s2">way to the top floor. If Mr. Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.300" end="00:01:32.700" style="s2">gets mad, we&#39;re both finished.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.000" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett, something&#39;s going on in the</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.600" end="00:01:36.800" style="s2">lobby.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.100" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.800" end="00:01:40.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a little girl downstairs, about</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.000" end="00:01:42.200" style="s2">five, asking for you. And</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.600" end="00:01:43.800" style="s2">she&#39;s holding a sign saying you owe her</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.200" end="00:01:45.700" style="s2">formula money.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.800" end="00:01:48.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ridiculous. Anyone can just waltz up to</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.700" end="00:01:48.200" style="s2">the top floor.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.200" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which one&#39;s Grant?</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.100" end="00:01:55.200" style="s2">Pay back my formula money.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.600" end="00:01:57.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey kiddo, this is Mr. Beckett&#39;s office.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.200" end="00:01:57.500" style="s2">You can&#39;t just walk in. Come out with me</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.100" end="00:01:59.900" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.500" end="00:02:01.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going. I&#39;m Grant&#39;s daughter. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.900" end="00:02:04.092" style="s2">here collect what he owes.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.492" end="00:02:06.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett&#39;s daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.092" end="00:02:07.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re Grant, the dad who owed my mom</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.192" end="00:02:09.192" style="s2">money and ran off?</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.292" end="00:02:10.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you come from? What&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.192" end="00:02:12.692" style="s2">mother&#39;s name?</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.092" end="00:02:14.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came from very very far away. My mom&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.692" end="00:02:17.592" style="s2">name is Eve. She says you owe us a lot</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.992" end="00:02:17.592" style="s2">of money.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:22.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.392" end="00:02:24.892" style="s2">Who else could it be?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.692" end="00:02:26.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t me. I didn&#39;t steal anything.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.892" end="00:02:28.692" style="s2">Someone set me up. You have to believe</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.492" end="00:02:28.692" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:32.892" style="s2">Eve, the evidence is solid. You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.492" end="00:02:36.692" style="s2">get away. You leaked the company&#39;s core</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.892" end="00:02:37.892" style="s2">secrets. The amount involved is huge.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.692" end="00:02:39.692" style="s2">Last night you were the one who handed</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.892" end="00:02:41.492" style="s2">me a glass of juice after I drank it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.692" end="00:02:45.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. You did something shameful</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.492" end="00:02:47.892" style="s2">yourself and now you dare frame me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.892" end="00:02:49.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, it really is you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.892" end="00:02:52.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.292" end="00:02:52.392" style="s2">even you don&#39;t believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.892" end="00:02:57.792" style="s2">Grant, you&#39;d rather believe an</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.292" end="00:02:59.492" style="s2">outsider&#39;s lies than a single word from</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.792" end="00:03:00.392" style="s2">me. You Becketts are all birds of a</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.492" end="00:03:01.392" style="s2">feather.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.392" end="00:03:04.092" style="s2">I hate you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.392" end="00:03:05.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, I knew it. You&#39;re not dead. You</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.092" end="00:03:07.792" style="s2">must still be alive.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.492" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, don&#39;t you play dumb and weasel out</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.792" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">of it. I have proof.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.992" end="00:03:17.792" style="s2">Mom wrote it all down, every single bit.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.392" end="00:03:17.792" style="s2">Don&#39;t even think about denying it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.092" end="00:03:22.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mom, where is she now?</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.592" end="00:03:25.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.792" end="00:03:27.192" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s sleeping in the little house.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.092" end="00:03:29.092" style="s2">When I woke up, I couldn&#39;t find her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.192" end="00:03:31.792" style="s2">Mommy said if she&#39;s gone, I should come</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.092" end="00:03:31.792" style="s2">find daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.892" end="00:03:34.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 years ago, you jumped into the sea</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.192" end="00:03:36.892" style="s2">without a word and now you&#39;ve left the</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.492" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">child all alone. Where on earth are you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.892" end="00:03:40.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve locked myself in a cage, Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.992" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t deny it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.092" end="00:03:48.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really is hers. Eve,</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.492" end="00:03:50.492" style="s2">you&#39;re alive and you had a daughter for</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.192" end="00:03:50.492" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.792" end="00:03:55.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8,000 for formula money, 8,000 for</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.292" end="00:03:58.492" style="s2">diapers, 10,000 for emotional damages,</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.792" end="00:03:59.492" style="s2">and 32,000 for mom&#39;s hardship pay. All</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.492" end="00:04:02.792" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.492" end="00:04:02.994" style="s2">That&#39;s 58,000 total, WeChat or Alipay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.792" end="00:04:07.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.994" end="00:04:07.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; spunky little spark exactly like Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.494" end="00:04:13.894" style="s2">Daddy will pay it. Come home with Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.394" end="00:04:17.094" style="s2">okay? Everything at home can be yours.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.894" end="00:04:18.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really? Do Do you have a big house?</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.094" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.094" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And less strawberry cake?</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.094" end="00:04:22.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More than that. All kinds of flavors.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.494" end="00:04:24.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are there</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.494" end="00:04:25.994" style="s2">lots and lots of dolls and building</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.394" end="00:04:27.894" style="s2">blocks and</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.994" end="00:04:30.194" style="s2">and remote control cars?</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.894" end="00:04:31.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have all of it. Whatever Lulu wants,</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.194" end="00:04:33.394" style="s2">home has it all.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:35.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, then I&#39;ll go back with you. But</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.394" end="00:04:35.794" style="s2">you still have to pay back what you owe</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.294" end="00:04:37.794" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.794" end="00:04:38.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. All right. Get the car. Back</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.794" end="00:04:40.394" style="s2">to the old house.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.594" end="00:04:42.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Beckett. I&#39;ll arrange it right</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.394" end="00:04:42.594" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.694" end="00:04:50.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, Grant&#39;s about to be here. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.294" end="00:04:50.094" style="s2">coming over today.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.694" end="00:04:55.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl, you&#39;re my own flesh and</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.694" end="00:04:57.694" style="s2">blood, and Grant is my stepson. If you</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.394" end="00:05:00.094" style="s2">two end up together, it&#39;s family tying</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.694" end="00:05:03.394" style="s2">into family. I&#39;ll make sure your wedding</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.094" end="00:05:03.394" style="s2">is arranged perfectly.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.294" end="00:05:14.094" style="s2">This child,</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.694" end="00:05:16.194" style="s2">why does she look so much like Eve?</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.094" end="00:05:18.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did this kid come from? That face</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.194" end="00:05:19.294" style="s2">is exactly like Eve&#39;s. Grant, where did</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.294" end="00:05:21.894" style="s2">this child come from?</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.294" end="00:05:23.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So filthy. Look, she&#39;s ruined your suit.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.894" end="00:05:26.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right, Grant. Where did you pick up this</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.894" end="00:05:26.294" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.894" end="00:05:33.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu has a mom. Lulu&#39;s mom is named Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.694" end="00:05:35.994" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s dad is Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.794" end="00:05:38.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That year, I watched Eve fall with my</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.994" end="00:05:41.394" style="s2">own eyes. Could it be Eve never died at</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.194" end="00:05:44.694" style="s2">all? Impossible. Absolutely impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.394" end="00:05:46.494" style="s2">Grant, is this child really Eve&#39;s?</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.694" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my daughter, Lucy.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.494" end="00:05:51.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve again.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.494" end="00:05:53.694" style="s2">She just won&#39;t go away.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.394" end="00:05:56.294" style="s2">Mom, this child came out of nowhere. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.694" end="00:05:58.594" style="s2">say we better look into it carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.294" end="00:06:00.594" style="s2">Don&#39;t let some schemer fool Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.594" end="00:06:02.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey&#39;s right. How can you just bring</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.594" end="00:06:04.595" style="s2">home a kid from nowhere? Grant, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.894" end="00:06:05.695" style="s2">let your soft heart get you fooled. Just</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.595" end="00:06:08.195" style="s2">them away already.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.695" end="00:06:09.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, this lady looks like the witch in</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.195" end="00:06:11.895" style="s2">cartoons.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.795" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">And this grandma, why is her chin all</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.895" end="00:06:14.495" style="s2">crooked?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.695" end="00:06:26.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This child&#39;s eyes and brows look so much</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.295" end="00:06:28.095" style="s2">like Grant as a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.095" end="00:06:28.995" style="s2">Grant, what&#39;s the story with this child?</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.095" end="00:06:31.495" style="s2">Explain.</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.995" end="00:06:32.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, this is Lucy. She&#39;s my daughter</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.495" end="00:06:33.095" style="s2">with Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.095" end="00:06:35.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.095" end="00:06:37.695" style="s2">Russell Beckett with a granddaughter?</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.595" end="00:06:39.395" style="s2">She&#39;s such a lovely child.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.695" end="00:06:41.095" style="s2">She looks exactly like Grant did as a</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.395" end="00:06:43.695" style="s2">kid.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.095" end="00:06:47.295" style="s2">I like her, love her. This girl is</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.695" end="00:06:47.295" style="s2">clearly a Beckett through and through.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.795" end="00:06:52.695" style="s2">Eve,</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.495" end="00:06:56.595" style="s2">where is she? She doesn&#39;t even show up</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.695" end="00:06:58.395" style="s2">herself, sends a five-year-old alone.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.595" end="00:07:00.295" style="s2">What kind of mother is she?</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.395" end="00:07:02.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does Eve even dare show her face?</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.295" end="00:07:03.895" style="s2">The shameful thing she did back then,</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.195" end="00:07:05.695" style="s2">stole the Beckett&#39;s project, caused huge</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.895" end="00:07:06.695" style="s2">losses. If she dares come, I&#39;ll be the</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.695" end="00:07:09.895" style="s2">first to throw her out.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.695" end="00:07:11.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mommy is not a bad person.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.895" end="00:07:13.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get hair samples from Grant and this</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.395" end="00:07:15.395" style="s2">child right now. Send them for a</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:16.795" style="s2">paternity test fastest speed possible.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.395" end="00:07:18.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I&#39;ll arrange it right away. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.795" end="00:07:20.895" style="s2">have the report by tomorrow morning at</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.295" end="00:07:20.895" style="s2">the earliest.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.895" end="00:07:29.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, are you sending Lulu away?</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.095" end="00:07:32.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.195" end="00:07:32.395" style="s2">Daddy won&#39;t send you away.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.595" end="00:07:40.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, don&#39;t send Lulu away, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.395" end="00:07:40.995" style="s2">Grandpa, don&#39;t chase Lulu away, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.295" end="00:07:50.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, come eat.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.295" end="00:08:07.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, can Lulu eat now?</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.795" end="00:08:08.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.995" end="00:08:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.297" end="00:08:13.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; grandpa seems so cold.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.297" end="00:08:16.297" style="s2">But he&#39;s actually pretty nice.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:17.297" style="s2">Not like that mean grandma and that mean</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.297" end="00:08:18.897" style="s2">auntie.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.297" end="00:08:19.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t let this little girl win the old</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.897" end="00:08:21.397" style="s2">man over.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.997" end="00:08:25.997" style="s2">I need to teach her a lesson so she</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.397" end="00:08:25.997" style="s2">backs off. Best if she runs off crying.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.697" end="00:08:31.597" style="s2">Eating only rice, that&#39;s no good. Here,</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.197" end="00:08:35.697" style="s2">have some soup. Build up your strength.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.597" end="00:08:35.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom always feeds me slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.997" end="00:08:41.697" style="s2">This grandma&#39;s hand moved so fast.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.097" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">She&#39;s clearly up to no good. Grandma&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.697" end="00:08:46.997" style="s2">an elder. Grandma drinks first.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.297" end="00:08:50.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trying to choke me to death.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.997" end="00:08:53.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m I&#39;m sorry, grandma. Lulu didn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.097" end="00:08:56.297" style="s2">it. Lulu just wanted you to drink first.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.997" end="00:08:58.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. It&#39;s fine. The kid means</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.297" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">well. It was my own carelessness. I spat</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.597" end="00:09:01.297" style="s2">it out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.297" end="00:09:04.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. You still want to hurt me. Not a</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.297" end="00:09:04.997" style="s2">chance, bad grandma.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.797" end="00:09:13.297" style="s2">I can&#39;t take it. Mommy sewed this for me</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.997" end="00:09:15.297" style="s2">herself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.297" end="00:09:17.297" style="s2">It smells like mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.297" end="00:09:18.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, we won&#39;t take it. Let the bear</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.297" end="00:09:20.297" style="s2">sleep with Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.497" end="00:09:22.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, do you think mommy is a bad</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.297" end="00:09:22.697" style="s2">woman?</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.197" end="00:09:29.997" style="s2">Why doesn&#39;t grandma and them like mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.497" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">And they say bad things about mommy too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.997" end="00:09:33.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:35.597" style="s2">Your mom is a very good, very kind</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.597" end="00:09:36.997" style="s2">person. Don&#39;t listen to their nonsense.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.597" end="00:09:38.897" style="s2">They don&#39;t know anything.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.997" end="00:09:40.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mommy is the best person in the</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.897" end="00:09:42.597" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.597" end="00:09:44.497" style="s2">I won&#39;t let anyone say bad things about</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.597" end="00:09:46.897" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.497" end="00:09:50.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. There. Me neither. Close your</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.897" end="00:09:50.097" style="s2">eyes and sleep now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.697" end="00:09:55.397" style="s2">Eve, where on earth are you? I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.597" end="00:09:58.097" style="s2">looking for you for 5 years. You owe me</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.397" end="00:09:58.097" style="s2">an explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.197" end="00:10:05.097" style="s2">Trace the route Lulu took. Track down</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.297" end="00:10:07.597" style="s2">every trace of Eve. Tear the place apart</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.097" end="00:10:09.097" style="s2">if you have to, but find her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.597" end="00:10:10.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.097" end="00:10:12.498" style="s2">that girl is obviously Eve&#39;s child. She</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.998" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">looks so much like her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.498" end="00:10:16.098" style="s2">Once the paternity test results come out</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.198" end="00:10:18.598" style="s2">tomorrow, she&#39;ll stay with the Becketts,</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.098" end="00:10:20.598" style="s2">rightfully so. And my marriage to Grant</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.598" end="00:10:22.398" style="s2">would be completely over, wouldn&#39;t it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.598" end="00:10:23.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The paternity test must not come out</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.398" end="00:10:26.098" style="s2">smoothly.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.898" end="00:10:27.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Samples were taken long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.098" end="00:10:31.198" style="s2">Grant&#39;s trusted men handled it the whole</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.698" end="00:10:31.198" style="s2">way. We can&#39;t even get near them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.998" end="00:10:36.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we can&#39;t change the results,</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.198" end="00:10:38.998" style="s2">we can strike from another angle.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.498" end="00:10:40.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, that move is brilliant. Even if</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.998" end="00:10:42.798" style="s2">they run the DNA test and confirm that</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.898" end="00:10:44.998" style="s2">girl is Grant&#39;s own child, so what? By</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.798" end="00:10:46.198" style="s2">then, we&#39;ll have sent her far, far away.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.998" end="00:10:48.898" style="s2">Like a needle in a haystack, how would</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.198" end="00:10:48.898" style="s2">they ever find her?</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.798" end="00:10:54.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open up. Open the door. Hand over my</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.998" end="00:10:56.098" style="s2">daughter Lulu right now, or I&#39;ll smash</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.898" end="00:10:58.298" style="s2">this door down.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.098" end="00:10:59.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did this punk come from? Get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.298" end="00:11:00.798" style="s2">Touch that door again, and I&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.598" end="00:11:02.998" style="s2">security throw you out.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.798" end="00:11:04.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here for my daughter. You Becketts</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.998" end="00:11:07.698" style="s2">are hiding her. Give me back my</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.498" end="00:11:09.098" style="s2">daughter, or you&#39;ll regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.698" end="00:11:09.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s all the noise out there?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.098" end="00:11:11.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.898" end="00:11:12.898" style="s2">some people showed up outside making a</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.298" end="00:11:15.998" style="s2">scene, claiming the young lady is his</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.898" end="00:11:18.598" style="s2">daughter, demanding we hand her over.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.998" end="00:11:18.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them in.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.898" end="00:11:24.198" style="s2">Lulu,</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.998" end="00:11:25.698" style="s2">my sweet girl, where have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.198" end="00:11:27.498" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s been looking everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.698" end="00:11:27.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, there you are, kiddo. Finally found</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.498" end="00:11:29.698" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.798" end="00:11:31.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Lulu, come with us now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.698" end="00:11:33.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry for the trouble, everyone. My</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.098" end="00:11:35.898" style="s2">girl&#39;s a handful, always running off.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.698" end="00:11:37.798" style="s2">Sorry for the hassle. I&#39;ll take her home</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.898" end="00:11:38.498" style="s2">now. I&#39;ll keep a closer eye on her from</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.798" end="00:11:39.998" style="s2">now on.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.498" end="00:11:42.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.998" end="00:11:43.098" style="s2">You&#39;re not my daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.298" end="00:11:45.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop right there.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.098" end="00:11:46.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, her real father&#39;s here to pick</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.098" end="00:11:48.198" style="s2">her up.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.498" end="00:11:50.098" style="s2">Just let him take the kid.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.198" end="00:11:51.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, Grant. A father-daughter</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.098" end="00:11:53.298" style="s2">reunion is a good thing. We can&#39;t just</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.898" end="00:11:55.898" style="s2">keep someone else&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.298" end="00:11:57.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say you&#39;re this child&#39;s father.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.898" end="00:11:58.598" style="s2">Then who is the mother? [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.598" end="00:12:00.698" style="s2">Explain yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.598" end="00:12:02.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five years ago, I saved a woman who</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.698" end="00:12:04.198" style="s2">jumped into the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.098" end="00:12:06.798" style="s2">Her name was Eve. After she recovered,</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.198" end="00:12:08.898" style="s2">we got married. Then Lulu was born. A</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.798" end="00:12:10.898" style="s2">while back, her mother passed away, so</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.898" end="00:12:12.198" style="s2">the kid ran off. I searched for days</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.898" end="00:12:12.299" style="s2">before I found this place.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.198" end="00:12:14.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.299" end="00:12:18.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; say you&#39;re my dad?</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.599" end="00:12:21.899" style="s2">Then tell me, what day was I born?</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.499" end="00:12:24.799" style="s2">What&#39;s my favorite food?</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.899" end="00:12:27.099" style="s2">Where do I live?</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.799" end="00:12:30.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You. You.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.099" end="00:12:30.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big liar. You want to kidnap a kid? Not</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.199" end="00:12:32.299" style="s2">a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.999" end="00:12:34.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid, why are you asking all this</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.299" end="00:12:37.099" style="s2">nonsense? I&#39;m your dad, and that&#39;s that.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.499" end="00:12:39.099" style="s2">Come with me right now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.099" end="00:12:40.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.099" end="00:12:42.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does the Beckett family have any sense</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.799" end="00:12:43.499" style="s2">of decency? Why are you keeping my</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.699" end="00:12:45.499" style="s2">daughter from me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.499" end="00:12:47.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me tell you, if you don&#39;t give Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.499" end="00:12:48.499" style="s2">back, I&#39;ll tell everyone out there. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.499" end="00:12:49.099" style="s2">say the Becketts abuse their power to</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.499" end="00:12:50.799" style="s2">bully people.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:51.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Think the Becketts are so</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.799" end="00:12:53.299" style="s2">great?</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.199" end="00:12:54.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got three minutes. You&#39;d better</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.299" end="00:12:56.099" style="s2">tell the truth or you&#39;ll face the</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.899" end="00:12:58.199" style="s2">consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.099" end="00:12:58.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m telling the truth. This is my</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.199" end="00:13:01.799" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.999" end="00:13:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call the cops now. Child enticement,</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.799" end="00:13:06.799" style="s2">trespassing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.199" end="00:13:09.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead. Go ahead and call them. I &#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.799" end="00:13:11.499" style="s2">got witnesses. I &#39;ve got evidence. Even</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.299" end="00:13:15.099" style="s2">if the cops come, I&#39;m just taking my own</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.499" end="00:13:15.099" style="s2">daughter home. It&#39;s only natural.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.099" end="00:13:20.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.199" end="00:13:22.899" style="s2">So well prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.099" end="00:13:24.299" style="s2">You sure put in some effort?</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.899" end="00:13:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut the crap.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.299" end="00:13:28.899" style="s2">Since you won&#39;t call the cops, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.099" end="00:13:28.899" style="s2">taking my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.199" end="00:13:33.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, come to grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.799" end="00:13:35.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.999" end="00:13:37.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guard the door. Have the Becketts lawyer</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.799" end="00:13:39.099" style="s2">call the cops. Let&#39;s see how long you</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.399" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">get for trespassing and child abduction.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.099" end="00:13:41.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Beckett.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:43.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In broad daylight. You, what are you</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.799" end="00:13:44.099" style="s2">doing? I&#39;m warning you, don&#39;t try</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.599" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.099" end="00:13:46.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To deal with a thug, you use a thug&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.099" end="00:13:49.099" style="s2">methods.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.999" end="00:13:51.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you dare touch my daughter today,</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.099" end="00:13:53.499" style="s2">you&#39;ll regret it. Stop trying to scare</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.099" end="00:13:55.199" style="s2">me. Anyway, so many neighbors saw me</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.499" end="00:13:56.699" style="s2">come in today. If I don&#39;t get out,</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.199" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">everyone outside will spit on the</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.699" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">Becketts and drown you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.299" end="00:14:04.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already called the cops. The</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.799" end="00:14:05.699" style="s2">hallway cameras, the fake IDs are all</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.299" end="00:14:07.999" style="s2">evidence. Guess how many years you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.699" end="00:14:07.999" style="s2">get.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.799" end="00:14:15.199" style="s2">And these IDs of yours, rushed jobs,</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.099" end="00:14:16.701" style="s2">aren&#39;t they? The ink still smudged.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.199" end="00:14:18.501" style="s2">The edges of the official seal are all</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.701" end="00:14:21.101" style="s2">blurred, and you still dare to show them</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.501" end="00:14:24.201" style="s2">off. You can either confess</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.101" end="00:14:25.901" style="s2">or I can help you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.201" end="00:14:28.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I confess. I&#39;ll tell you everything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.901" end="00:14:29.501" style="s2">Please don&#39;t hit me. Don&#39;t hit me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.201" end="00:14:31.901" style="s2">Last night,</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.501" end="00:14:33.601" style="s2">someone called me and said said they&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.901" end="00:14:34.901" style="s2">give me a million and told me to come to</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.601" end="00:14:36.701" style="s2">the Becketts today and take away a</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.901" end="00:14:38.501" style="s2">little girl named Lucy. Take her as far</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.701" end="00:14:40.601" style="s2">as possible. Never let her come back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:41.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I We were blinded by greed for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.601" end="00:14:43.401" style="s2">We saw all that money and and just</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.801" end="00:14:45.001" style="s2">agreed. Please spare us just this once.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.401" end="00:14:46.301" style="s2">We&#39;ll never do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.001" end="00:14:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.301" end="00:14:49.701" style="s2">Pretty generous, aren&#39;t they? Don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.201" end="00:14:51.201" style="s2">him dirty the floor of the old house.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.701" end="00:14:51.901" style="s2">Drag him out. Send him straight to the</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.201" end="00:14:54.201" style="s2">police.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.901" end="00:14:56.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Becket.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.201" end="00:14:57.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A million to make my daughter leave.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.101" end="00:14:59.301" style="s2">That&#39;s quite a move. I just don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.601" end="00:15:02.501" style="s2">who&#39;d have the nerve</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.301" end="00:15:02.501" style="s2">to touch the Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.901" end="00:15:06.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That really scared me to death. Scammers</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.701" end="00:15:08.701" style="s2">these days are way too bold. They&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.501" end="00:15:10.301" style="s2">anything for money. So terrifying.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.701" end="00:15:11.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Good thing you&#39;re so smart,</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.301" end="00:15:12.901" style="s2">Grant. You saw through the scam</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.301" end="00:15:14.601" style="s2">instantly. Otherwise, the bad guys would</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.901" end="00:15:17.301" style="s2">have really taken the child, and that</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.601" end="00:15:17.301" style="s2">would have been awful.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.501" end="00:15:22.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Becket, sir, the paternity test</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.301" end="00:15:22.901" style="s2">results are out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.001" end="00:15:30.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not necessary. This report the moment I</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.101" end="00:15:32.001" style="s2">saw her, I knew Lulu is my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.901" end="00:15:34.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.001" end="00:15:34.901" style="s2">come to my study.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.201" end="00:15:41.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I let today slide out of respect</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.701" end="00:15:44.501" style="s2">for you, but if there&#39;s a next time, I</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.801" end="00:15:45.901" style="s2">won&#39;t hold back at all.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.501" end="00:15:48.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what I&#39;m doing about this.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.901" end="00:15:50.701" style="s2">Before, you refused to marry, refused to</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.601" end="00:15:52.901" style="s2">settle down. I was anxious, always</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.701" end="00:15:54.901" style="s2">pushing you to start a family. Now you</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.901" end="00:15:57.701" style="s2">have a daughter of your own.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.901" end="00:15:58.901" style="s2">I won&#39;t pressure you anymore. But Lulu,</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.701" end="00:16:01.501" style="s2">she must return to the Becketts with</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.901" end="00:16:02.701" style="s2">honor, take her place in the family.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.501" end="00:16:04.001" style="s2">Entering the family tree and the welcome</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.701" end="00:16:06.101" style="s2">banquet, not one can be skipped.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.001" end="00:16:09.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what I want, too. I&#39;ll give Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.101" end="00:16:09.301" style="s2">every right she deserves.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.601" end="00:16:17.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. I will never let Lucy secure her</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.001" end="00:16:19.502" style="s2">place as the Beckett heiress. Audrey is</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.301" end="00:16:21.602" style="s2">the next Beckett matriarch. I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.502" end="00:16:23.802" style="s2">allow it. I won&#39;t let anyone stand in</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.602" end="00:16:25.302" style="s2">Audrey&#39;s way.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.802" end="00:16:27.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teddy,</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.302" end="00:16:29.702" style="s2">why isn&#39;t mommy here to pick up Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.402" end="00:16:29.702" style="s2">yet?</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.802" end="00:16:36.302" style="s2">What is mommy doing?</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.602" end="00:16:37.502" style="s2">Did she eat her meals properly?</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.302" end="00:16:41.802" style="s2">Does</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.502" end="00:16:41.802" style="s2">does she miss miss Lulu?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.802" end="00:16:50.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, Lulu misses you so much. Where on</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.902" end="00:16:50.702" style="s2">earth are you?</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.802" end="00:16:53.502" style="s2">Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.102" end="00:16:54.102" style="s2">did you find out where Eve is? Any</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.502" end="00:16:55.302" style="s2">progress?</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.102" end="00:16:56.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett, we&#39;re searching the whole</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.302" end="00:16:57.902" style="s2">city. Miss Morgan seems to be hiding her</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.602" end="00:16:58.702" style="s2">tracks on purpose. We still don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.902" end="00:17:00.402" style="s2">any solid leads.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.702" end="00:17:02.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send more men. Expand the search to</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.402" end="00:17:04.202" style="s2">every nearby city. Cover all train</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.102" end="00:17:05.902" style="s2">stations, airports, and highway exits.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.202" end="00:17:07.202" style="s2">Also, buy a batch of the newest kids&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.902" end="00:17:07.702" style="s2">toys on the market and send them to the</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.202" end="00:17:10.602" style="s2">old mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.702" end="00:17:13.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Beckett, right away.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.602" end="00:17:16.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, where are you? You won&#39;t even see</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.302" end="00:17:16.202" style="s2">your own daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.602" end="00:17:22.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what a great chance this was, and</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.902" end="00:17:24.402" style="s2">she still didn&#39;t get Lucy sent away.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.002" end="00:17:25.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush? She&#39;s a 5-year-old kid.</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.402" end="00:17:27.302" style="s2">What can she possibly do?</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.402" end="00:17:28.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I not be anxious? If this keeps</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.302" end="00:17:29.102" style="s2">up, will there still be room for us in</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.602" end="00:17:30.902" style="s2">this house?</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.102" end="00:17:32.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can run the day, but not forever.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.902" end="00:17:33.902" style="s2">Lucy isn&#39;t a real threat at all. Right</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.302" end="00:17:34.602" style="s2">now, the priority is your marriage to</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.902" end="00:17:36.002" style="s2">Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.602" end="00:17:36.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Grant won&#39;t even give me the time of</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.002" end="00:17:39.302" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.902" end="00:17:40.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl. Men who&#39;s ever truly immune</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.302" end="00:17:43.402" style="s2">to temptation.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.802" end="00:17:45.302" style="s2">Just drop by Grant&#39;s office more often.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.402" end="00:17:47.402" style="s2">Bring him home-cooked meals. Brew him</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.302" end="00:17:48.902" style="s2">coffee. Remember, dress up pretty. The</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.402" end="00:17:50.402" style="s2">gentler and sweeter, the better.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.902" end="00:17:52.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, will this really work?</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.402" end="00:17:56.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. Men fall for that every time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.702" end="00:17:56.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got it, mom. Whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.502" end="00:18:01.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, now that you&#39;re staying with the</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.502" end="00:18:04.302" style="s2">Becketts, she&#39;s a real deal, the Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.702" end="00:18:07.202" style="s2">heiress. Big families like ours live by</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.302" end="00:18:09.202" style="s2">rules. Nothing works without rules.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.202" end="00:18:11.702" style="s2">Next, I&#39;ll tell you the Beckett house</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.202" end="00:18:12.502" style="s2">rules. Rule one, you must be up by 6:00</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.702" end="00:18:14.902" style="s2">every morning.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.502" end="00:18:16.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six? Six what?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.902" end="00:18:19.502" style="s2">What time exactly?</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.102" end="00:18:21.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, playing dumb, are we? Rule two, no</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.502" end="00:18:22.603" style="s2">shouting in house.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.303" end="00:18:26.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.603" end="00:18:28.003" style="s2">is Lulu talking right now, shouting?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.103" end="00:18:28.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rule three, no interrupting when your</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.003" end="00:18:29.603" style="s2">elders speak.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.703" end="00:18:31.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm-mm.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.603" end="00:18:33.403" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s not talking anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.503" end="00:18:35.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When your elders are standing, you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.403" end="00:18:39.803" style="s2">sit.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.603" end="00:18:43.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But auntie, you&#39;re sitting right now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.803" end="00:18:43.103" style="s2">Was auntie being rude?</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:49.403" style="s2">Hmm. What rules? You&#39;re just picking on</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:49.403" style="s2">Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.303" end="00:18:55.103" style="s2">Got it. Grandma, auntie, Lulu will learn</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.403" end="00:18:57.803" style="s2">the rules properly.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.103" end="00:19:00.303" style="s2">I won&#39;t embarrass grandma, grandpa, or</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.803" end="00:19:02.903" style="s2">daddy. You want to bully me? Not a</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.303" end="00:19:02.903" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.903" end="00:19:12.103" style="s2">I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.003" end="00:19:12.103" style="s2">I&#39;ll take this pair.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.503" end="00:19:17.903" style="s2">Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.903" end="00:19:20.803" style="s2">Grandma won&#39;t find her shoes. She&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.903" end="00:19:20.803" style="s2">so worried.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.703" end="00:19:27.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I searched the whole closet before</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.503" end="00:19:29.903" style="s2">going out. Those diamond high heels, I</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.303" end="00:19:33.703" style="s2">had to just wear any pair. Mrs. Brooks,</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.903" end="00:19:36.603" style="s2">Mrs. Lane, you&#39;re here so early.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.703" end="00:19:38.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my, Mrs. Beckett, those shoes look</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.603" end="00:19:39.803" style="s2">unfamiliar. Didn&#39;t you say a while back</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.303" end="00:19:41.303" style="s2">you&#39;d bought a new custom pair of heels</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.803" end="00:19:42.403" style="s2">covered in diamonds? Such an important</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.303" end="00:19:42.503" style="s2">event today. Why aren&#39;t you wearing</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.403" end="00:19:44.703" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.503" end="00:19:46.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. We all came today especially</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.703" end="00:19:50.003" style="s2">hoping to see them. Don&#39;t tell me Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.503" end="00:19:50.003" style="s2">Beckett was just bragging to us.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.703" end="00:20:02.303" style="s2">What what the hell is this?</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.003" end="00:20:07.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Beckett, this is your new reporting</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.803" end="00:20:08.903" style="s2">tool.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.703" end="00:20:10.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tell me at today&#39;s project</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.903" end="00:20:11.603" style="s2">meeting, Miss Beckett, you&#39;re going to</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.103" end="00:20:12.403" style="s2">make us pancakes for afternoon tea on</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.603" end="00:20:15.103" style="s2">the spot.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.403" end="00:20:17.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy, you must have secretly swapped my</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.103" end="00:20:17.803" style="s2">tablet.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.103" end="00:20:22.103" style="s2">Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.203" end="00:20:23.405" style="s2">you saw it all.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.103" end="00:20:25.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy messes with us every</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.405" end="00:20:26.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; single day. I&#39;m losing all my face over</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.605" end="00:20:28.205" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.205" end="00:20:30.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not much better off.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.205" end="00:20:32.205" style="s2">That girl is way too sly. She never</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.405" end="00:20:34.205" style="s2">leaves a single trace.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.205" end="00:20:35.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do we do? We can&#39;t just let her</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.205" end="00:20:36.505" style="s2">run wild like this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.205" end="00:20:38.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.505" end="00:20:39.605" style="s2">I&#39;ll go get your dad to settle this.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.305" end="00:20:41.305" style="s2">Your dad won&#39;t let it slide.</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.605" end="00:20:43.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad cares about rules the most. If he</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.305" end="00:20:46.505" style="s2">finds out how naughty she&#39;s been,</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.405" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">he&#39;ll definitely dislike her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.505" end="00:20:52.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, Grandpa, drop the newspaper.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.805" end="00:20:53.805" style="s2">Play with Lulu, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.005" end="00:20:55.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay, okay. What does Grandpa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.805" end="00:20:56.905" style="s2">good girl want to play? Grandpa will</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.405" end="00:20:58.405" style="s2">play whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.905" end="00:21:00.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu is giving Grandpa a makeover. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.405" end="00:21:01.605" style="s2">make Grandpa the handsomest old man in</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.405" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">the world.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.605" end="00:21:05.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Today Grandpa is handing over this</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.705" end="00:21:07.705" style="s2">old face of mine to our little makeup</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.305" end="00:21:07.705" style="s2">artist.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.905" end="00:21:16.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, Grandpa looks great. Even better</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.805" end="00:21:16.605" style="s2">than Granny Brooks downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.884" end="00:21:21.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.205" end="00:21:23.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, what are you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:27.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, come here. You&#39;re not getting out</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.605" end="00:21:27.705" style="s2">of this. The whole family has to match.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.705" end="00:21:38.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, the way you look right now, if your</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.905" end="00:21:39.305" style="s2">old army buddies saw this, they&#39;d laugh</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.005" end="00:21:41.605" style="s2">their teeth out.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.305" end="00:21:45.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do they know? My granddaughter did</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.605" end="00:21:45.305" style="s2">this for me. They wish they had this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.705" end="00:21:49.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This, this is outrageous. Russ,</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.605" end="00:21:51.705" style="s2">aren&#39;t you going to stop this? This</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.905" end="00:21:53.005" style="s2">little girl has no manners at all. How</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.705" end="00:21:54.305" style="s2">can she scribble all over an adult&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.005" end="00:21:55.505" style="s2">face? What will people think if this</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:57.105" style="s2">gets out? They&#39;ll think the Becketts</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.505" end="00:21:59.205" style="s2">have no upbringing at all.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.105" end="00:22:00.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think Lulu has real talent. She did a</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.205" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">pretty good job.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.505" end="00:22:04.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, you just keep spoiling her. She&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.705" end="00:22:07.205" style="s2">be ruined sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.905" end="00:22:08.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Granny, do you want makeup too?</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.205" end="00:22:11.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.605" end="00:22:12.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to do my makeup? Yeah, Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.005" end="00:22:15.105" style="s2">and Daddy both got it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.705" end="00:22:17.005" style="s2">So Lulu wants to do Granny too.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.105" end="00:22:19.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, that&#39;s fine. Granny has things</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.005" end="00:22:19.405" style="s2">to do.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.505" end="00:22:22.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you want Lulu to do your makeup,</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.105" end="00:22:24.305" style="s2">Grandma? Are you saying Lulu&#39;s makeup</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.905" end="00:22:26.506" style="s2">looks bad?</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.305" end="00:22:28.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the kid&#39;s little gift. Don&#39;t crush</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.506" end="00:22:31.706" style="s2">her confidence.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.906" end="00:22:33.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no. I, I just wanted to check on</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.706" end="00:22:35.206" style="s2">dinner in the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.206" end="00:22:37.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The servants are watching the food. No</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.206" end="00:22:37.706" style="s2">rush.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.706" end="00:22:42.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, Lulu, go ahead, but you have to be</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.706" end="00:22:44.506" style="s2">careful. Don&#39;t put on too.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.306" end="00:22:46.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, your mouth is too big. Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.506" end="00:22:49.206" style="s2">will make it smaller for you. And why is</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.806" end="00:22:53.206" style="s2">your face so dark, Grandma?</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.206" end="00:22:53.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu will make it whiter for you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.506" end="00:22:56.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.506" end="00:22:57.706" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s skills are getting better and</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.106" end="00:22:58.106" style="s2">better. She&#39;s got the style of a makeup</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.706" end="00:22:59.806" style="s2">master.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.106" end="00:23:02.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, don&#39;t you think Lulu&#39;s makeup</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.806" end="00:23:04.306" style="s2">looks nice? Isn&#39;t it super pretty?</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.006" end="00:23:06.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So pretty. Lulu&#39;s got clever hands.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.306" end="00:23:08.006" style="s2">Grandma loves it. This girl, she went so</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.506" end="00:23:09.906" style="s2">hard on me. She definitely did it on</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.006" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">purpose. When I get the chance, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.906" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">give her a good lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.106" end="00:23:21.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, how do you end up like this? You</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.406" end="00:23:23.706" style="s2">look like a clown.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.906" end="00:23:24.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all Lucy. She dragged me into doing</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.706" end="00:23:26.506" style="s2">makeup.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.306" end="00:23:27.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you just let her? Couldn&#39;t you</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.506" end="00:23:28.606" style="s2">dodge it?</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.006" end="00:23:30.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your dad was backing her up. Where could</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.606" end="00:23:33.306" style="s2">I hide? She did it on purpose to make me</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.706" end="00:23:33.306" style="s2">look bad.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.506" end="00:23:37.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So young and already such a good little</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.306" end="00:23:38.406" style="s2">actress. What will she be like when she</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.906" end="00:23:40.206" style="s2">grows up?</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.406" end="00:23:42.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your dad treats Lucy like the apple of</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.206" end="00:23:44.006" style="s2">his eye now, like she&#39;s made of glass.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.506" end="00:23:45.106" style="s2">What can I do?</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.006" end="00:23:48.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.106" end="00:23:48.806" style="s2">our life is just too miserable.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.306" end="00:23:54.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For now, we just have to endure it. Wait</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.506" end="00:23:58.206" style="s2">for a chance, then deal with her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.306" end="00:23:58.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When are you coming to take Lulu home?</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.306" end="00:24:02.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu misses her mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.306" end="00:24:05.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.306" end="00:24:07.106" style="s2">Daddy, do you miss mommy too?</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.506" end="00:24:08.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.106" end="00:24:11.106" style="s2">Daddy misses her too.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.906" end="00:24:14.306" style="s2">Misses your mommy very much</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.106" end="00:24:14.306" style="s2">every single day.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.806" end="00:24:18.206" style="s2">Eve, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.506" end="00:24:23.506" style="s2">You&#39;d even abandon your child?</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.506" end="00:24:23.506" style="s2">You&#39;re so heartless.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.606" end="00:24:29.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.206" end="00:24:30.207" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s here with you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.107" end="00:24:33.507" style="s2">Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.207" end="00:24:33.507" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s here with daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.707" end="00:24:54.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, mommy&#39;s coming for you. I&#39;m sorry</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.007" end="00:24:56.807" style="s2">for keeping you waiting so long.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.807" end="00:25:00.307" style="s2">And everyone who framed me back then,</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.807" end="00:25:00.307" style="s2">not one of them will get away.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.107" end="00:25:11.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett, we have news about Miss</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.107" end="00:25:14.908" style="s2">Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.507" end="00:25:14.908" style="s2">Tell me where she is.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.707" end="00:25:19.007" style="s2">Our people shot this at an airport</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.007" end="00:25:21.207" style="s2">overseas, but she vanished after leaving</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.007" end="00:25:22.707" style="s2">the airport. We&#39;re following up on it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.207" end="00:25:25.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.707" end="00:25:27.707" style="s2">It&#39;s Eve. I&#39;d know her even in ashes.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.607" end="00:25:28.908" style="s2">Trace her flight and entry route. Dig</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.707" end="00:25:31.207" style="s2">deeper.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.908" end="00:25:31.707" style="s2">Any news, tell me immediately, no matter</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.207" end="00:25:34.908" style="s2">how late.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.707" end="00:25:34.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, right away.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.507" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll get to the bottom of what happened</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.807" end="00:25:43.507" style="s2">back then</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.607" end="00:25:45.807" style="s2">and clear your name.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.507" end="00:25:48.408" style="s2">Eve, this time I&#39;ll never let you leave</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.807" end="00:25:48.408" style="s2">me again.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.207" end="00:26:00.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, good, good. Just like Russell&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.307" end="00:26:00.107" style="s2">granddaughter, beautifully written.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.007" end="00:26:04.807" style="s2">Get this framed and hang it in the most</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.908" end="00:26:05.908" style="s2">prominent spot in my study. This is my</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.807" end="00:26:09.507" style="s2">granddaughter&#39;s first time doing</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.908" end="00:26:09.507" style="s2">calligraphy. I&#39;ve got to keep this safe.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.507" end="00:26:15.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.408" end="00:26:17.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s juice juice. Grandpa, the tea is so</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.807" end="00:26:19.507" style="s2">bitter bitter. Lulu won&#39;t let grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.807" end="00:26:22.307" style="s2">drink bitter stuff. Grandpa should have</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.507" end="00:26:22.307" style="s2">something sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.207" end="00:26:29.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little smarty pants. You really are</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.507" end="00:26:30.809" style="s2">grandpa&#39;s little sunshine. I really want</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.408" end="00:26:32.509" style="s2">to give everything I own to my</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.809" end="00:26:34.709" style="s2">granddaughter. Not to that brat Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.509" end="00:26:36.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, is there anything you want?</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.709" end="00:26:36.609" style="s2">Whatever it is, grandpa will buy it for</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.309" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.609" end="00:26:41.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, do you have lots of money?</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.309" end="00:26:42.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, even the stars in the sky.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.109" end="00:26:42.509" style="s2">Grandpa will find a way to get them for</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.309" end="00:26:43.909" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:45.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu wants for grandpa to live a long,</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.909" end="00:26:46.409" style="s2">long life and stay nice and healthy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.309" end="00:26:49.409" style="s2">Then</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.409" end="00:26:50.709" style="s2">then grandpa can always play with Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.409" end="00:26:52.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.709" end="00:26:55.309" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.909" end="00:26:58.909" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure to live well</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.309" end="00:26:58.909" style="s2">and watch our Lulu grow up.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.509" end="00:27:05.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This little girl sure knows how to sweet</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.109" end="00:27:06.409" style="s2">talk. She&#39;s got the old man wrapped</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.509" end="00:27:08.609" style="s2">around her finger.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.409" end="00:27:10.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me about it. At this rate, one of</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.609" end="00:27:14.409" style="s2">these days he&#39;ll get so happy he&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.509" end="00:27:14.409" style="s2">hand us over to Lucy as her maids.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.609" end="00:27:20.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Beckett,</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.709" end="00:27:21.709" style="s2">are you sure 20% of Beckett group shares</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.509" end="00:27:22.209" style="s2">transferred directly to Miss Lucy</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.709" end="00:27:23.609" style="s2">Beckett?</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.209" end="00:27:24.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.609" end="00:27:26.809" style="s2">This is my welcome gift to my eldest</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.809" end="00:27:27.909" style="s2">granddaughter on Lulu&#39;s 18th birthday.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.809" end="00:27:30.409" style="s2">The shares transfer to her</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.909" end="00:27:31.509" style="s2">automatically. Until then, I&#39;ll hold the</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.409" end="00:27:32.809" style="s2">shares in trust.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.509" end="00:27:34.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood, Chairman Beckett. I&#39;ll draft</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.809" end="00:27:36.909" style="s2">the supplementary agreement today. 20%</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.609" end="00:27:38.509" style="s2">of Beckett group shares worth billions.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.909" end="00:27:39.509" style="s2">The old man didn&#39;t even blink. Just gave</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.509" end="00:27:41.409" style="s2">it to this granddaughter he only just</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.509" end="00:27:42.909" style="s2">got back. You can tell how much he dotes</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.409" end="00:27:45.509" style="s2">on her. The Becketts are in for a</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.909" end="00:27:45.509" style="s2">shakeup.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.609" end="00:27:51.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, something huge happened.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.009" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now?</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.109" end="00:27:54.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ever since Lucy set foot in the Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:54.809" style="s2">house, there hasn&#39;t been one peaceful</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.109" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.809" end="00:27:59.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard that dad&#39;s transferring 20% of</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.609" end="00:28:02.709" style="s2">Beckett group shares to Lucy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.709" end="00:28:04.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? 20% of the shares? Is the old man</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.709" end="00:28:07.509" style="s2">insane? Does he know how much money that</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.509" end="00:28:08.909" style="s2">is? All the doting and spoiling, I put</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.509" end="00:28:10.609" style="s2">up with it. But now he&#39;s given the</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.909" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">shares to Lucy too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.609" end="00:28:15.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what about us?</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.009" end="00:28:16.309" style="s2">All these years in the Becketts and we</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.009" end="00:28:17.209" style="s2">get nothing?</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.309" end="00:28:18.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.209" end="00:28:20.409" style="s2">We can&#39;t just sit and wait. We</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.809" end="00:28:23.209" style="s2">absolutely can&#39;t let the Beckett family</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.409" end="00:28:24.609" style="s2">assets go to Lucy. Audrey, listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.209" end="00:28:26.109" style="s2">You have to lock down the marriage with</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.609" end="00:28:28.709" style="s2">Grant as soon as possible.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.109" end="00:28:31.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But but Grant won&#39;t even look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.709" end="00:28:33.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless. If he ignores you, find a way</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.009" end="00:28:34.710" style="s2">to make him notice you. Silly girl. Only</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.309" end="00:28:35.510" style="s2">this way can we get a foothold in the</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.710" end="00:28:39.710" style="s2">Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.510" end="00:28:41.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what what should I do?</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.710" end="00:28:43.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s asking you, do you want to be</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:45.010" style="s2">Grant&#39;s wife?</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.110" end="00:28:47.310" style="s2">Do you want a grand wedding with Grant?</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.010" end="00:28:50.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I do. It&#39;s all I dream about.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.310" end="00:28:50.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do as I say.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.010" end="00:28:55.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, will this really work? If this gets</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.210" end="00:28:58.010" style="s2">out, the fallout would be unthinkable.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.910" end="00:28:59.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me, scared? Aren&#39;t you scared Grant will</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.010" end="00:29:01.110" style="s2">marry another woman? Aren&#39;t you scared</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.310" end="00:29:03.010" style="s2">Lucy will walk all over you forever? Now</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.110" end="00:29:05.010" style="s2">we have no choice. We have to try.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.010" end="00:29:08.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, mom. I&#39;ll listen to you. Whatever</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.010" end="00:29:08.210" style="s2">you say, I&#39;ll do it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.810" end="00:29:12.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Beckett, congratulations. The</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.510" end="00:29:13.010" style="s2">Becketts have an heir now. This is truly</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.010" end="00:29:14.110" style="s2">wonderful news.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.010" end="00:29:15.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I fell in love with this baby at first</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.110" end="00:29:17.110" style="s2">sight. Those big eyes look just like Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.810" end="00:29:17.410" style="s2">Beckett&#39;s. Just wait and enjoy the good</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.110" end="00:29:18.510" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.410" end="00:29:19.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chairman Beckett, congratulations. Now</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.510" end="00:29:21.710" style="s2">that Beckett Group has an heir to carry</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.810" end="00:29:23.510" style="s2">on, it&#39;ll only thrive even more.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.710" end="00:29:25.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you all for the kind words. Thanks</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.510" end="00:29:26.910" style="s2">all for taking time to come support the</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.310" end="00:29:27.610" style="s2">Becketts today.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.910" end="00:29:29.010" style="s2">End the witness.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.610" end="00:29:30.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does Mr. Beckett suddenly have a</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.010" end="00:29:32.310" style="s2">daughter hid her all these years before</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.610" end="00:29:35.810" style="s2">daring to claim her? How interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.310" end="00:29:38.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows? Grandma, what&#39;s that smell?</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.810" end="00:29:38.710" style="s2">So stinky.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.710" end="00:29:42.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, what are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.510" end="00:29:44.710" style="s2">There&#39;s no smell.</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.710" end="00:29:47.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, have you not brushed your teeth</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.710" end="00:29:49.510" style="s2">for days?</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.010" end="00:29:52.010" style="s2">Daddy says if you don&#39;t brush, germs</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.510" end="00:29:54.410" style="s2">grow and your mouth stinks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.010" end="00:29:55.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, what nonsense are you saying?</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.410" end="00:29:58.110" style="s2">Grandma brushes her teeth every day.</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.810" end="00:29:59.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Teacher says people who say mean things</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.110" end="00:30:03.510" style="s2">get stinky mouths</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.910" end="00:30:03.510" style="s2">and they get cavities too.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.510" end="00:30:16.910" style="s2">Uncle Special Assistant, what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.610" end="00:30:19.010" style="s2">It&#39;s so pretty. It even has a bow.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.910" end="00:30:21.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu wants to hold it and play for a</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.010" end="00:30:22.010" style="s2">bit.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.110" end="00:30:23.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the microphone the young miss</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.010" end="00:30:25.410" style="s2">will use on stage. You can play with it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.710" end="00:30:27.410" style="s2">Don&#39;t lose it. We&#39;ll need it later.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.410" end="00:30:30.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm, got it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.410" end="00:30:30.710" style="s2">Just for a little while.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.110" end="00:30:34.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still need to double check the speech</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.410" end="00:30:36.712" style="s2">schedule. Miss, don&#39;t wander off on your</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.512" end="00:30:36.712" style="s2">okay?</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.912" end="00:30:43.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Grant? It&#39;s this late and he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.412" end="00:30:44.912" style="s2">still not here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.212" end="00:30:46.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett is in the study right now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:47.112" style="s2">Said he has something to deal with.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.312" end="00:30:49.112" style="s2">Wants us to wait a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.112" end="00:30:51.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at the time. Still busy with work.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.112" end="00:30:52.912" style="s2">Go. Hurry to the study and call him</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.312" end="00:30:54.612" style="s2">down. The guests are all waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.912" end="00:30:56.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russ, perfect timing. I&#39;m heading</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.612" end="00:30:57.012" style="s2">upstairs anyway. I&#39;ll just go call Grant</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.412" end="00:31:00.112" style="s2">on the way.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.012" end="00:31:02.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Go ahead then. Tell him to hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.112" end="00:31:06.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey should be in the study by now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.512" end="00:31:06.012" style="s2">Wait till I catch them red-handed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.112" end="00:31:13.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you all hidden? Daddy&#39;s coming to</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.012" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.012" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All hidden.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.712" end="00:31:20.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.612" end="00:31:22.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.912" end="00:31:25.412" style="s2">I have something to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.912" end="00:31:28.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mean lady is really really</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.412" end="00:31:30.712" style="s2">annoying. Always interrupting me and</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.012" end="00:31:30.712" style="s2">daddy&#39;s game.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.812" end="00:31:35.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.312" end="00:31:38.212" style="s2">I really like you. From the first time I</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.712" end="00:31:38.812" style="s2">saw you at the Becketts, I fell in love.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.212" end="00:31:41.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.812" end="00:31:44.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years, you&#39;re the only one in</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.112" end="00:31:46.612" style="s2">my heart. Why won&#39;t you just accept me?</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.812" end="00:31:47.512" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with me? I can change</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.612" end="00:31:48.712" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.512" end="00:31:51.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey,</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.712" end="00:31:52.412" style="s2">take one more step and I won&#39;t spare</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.212" end="00:31:54.012" style="s2">your dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.412" end="00:31:55.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it because of Eve?</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.012" end="00:31:57.512" style="s2">You still have feelings for Eve. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.812" end="00:32:00.712" style="s2">why you&#39;re pushing me away, right?</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:32:00.712" style="s2">What&#39;s so great about her?</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.112" end="00:32:07.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear guests,</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.512" end="00:32:08.912" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.412" end="00:32:10.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.912" end="00:32:13.312" style="s2">I really like you. From the first time I</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.912" end="00:32:13.812" style="s2">saw you at the Becketts, I fell in love.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.312" end="00:32:16.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.812" end="00:32:17.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years, you&#39;re the only one in</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.112" end="00:32:19.312" style="s2">my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.112" end="00:32:20.912" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you just accept me?</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.312" end="00:32:21.512" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with me? I can change</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.912" end="00:32:22.712" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.512" end="00:32:25.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey,</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.712" end="00:32:26.212" style="s2">take one more step and I won&#39;t spare</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.112" end="00:32:28.512" style="s2">your dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.212" end="00:32:29.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My god, what&#39;s going on here? Is this</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.512" end="00:32:31.412" style="s2">live?</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.612" end="00:32:32.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t it obvious? Mr. Beckett&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.412" end="00:32:34.512" style="s2">stepsister is chasing him.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.612" end="00:32:35.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And pulling this at the welcome banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.512" end="00:32:38.212" style="s2">She&#39;s way too eager to marry into the</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.912" end="00:32:39.813" style="s2">Becketts. So humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.212" end="00:32:41.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s happening? How is their</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.813" end="00:32:44.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; conversation playing through the living</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.213" end="00:32:45.913" style="s2">room speakers? No. If this goes on, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.013" end="00:32:48.013" style="s2">all over. Audrey&#39;s reputation will be</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.913" end="00:32:51.013" style="s2">ruined, and the marriage will be off. I</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.013" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">have to stop it now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.013" end="00:32:56.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mean lady is so</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.013" end="00:32:59.113" style="s2">so annoying. Always interrupting my game</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.113" end="00:32:59.113" style="s2">time with Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.913" end="00:33:03.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.413" end="00:33:05.313" style="s2">I really like you. I fell in love with</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.913" end="00:33:06.313" style="s2">you the first time I came to the</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.313" end="00:33:06.913" style="s2">Becketts and saw you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.313" end="00:33:09.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.913" end="00:33:12.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years, you&#39;re the only one in</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.413" end="00:33:14.613" style="s2">my heart. Why won&#39;t you ever accept me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.913" end="00:33:15.613" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong with me? I can change</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.613" end="00:33:16.813" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.613" end="00:33:18.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey,</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.813" end="00:33:19.713" style="s2">take one more step,</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.513" end="00:33:20.513" style="s2">and don&#39;t blame me for sparing your</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.713" end="00:33:22.313" style="s2">dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.513" end="00:33:23.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it because of Eve?</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.313" end="00:33:25.613" style="s2">You still have Eve in your heart. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.913" end="00:33:28.613" style="s2">why you&#39;re pushing me away, right?</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.613" end="00:33:28.613" style="s2">What&#39;s so great about her?</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.213" end="00:33:36.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Distinguished guests, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.413" end="00:33:38.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.913" end="00:33:40.913" style="s2">I really like you. From the first time I</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.913" end="00:33:41.313" style="s2">came to the Becketts and saw you, I fell</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.913" end="00:33:41.913" style="s2">in love.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.313" end="00:33:44.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.913" end="00:33:45.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years, you&#39;re the only one in</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.013" end="00:33:47.713" style="s2">my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.213" end="00:33:48.513" style="s2">Why won&#39;t you ever accept me? What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.713" end="00:33:49.613" style="s2">wrong with me?</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.513" end="00:33:50.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can change anything.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.613" end="00:33:52.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey,</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.713" end="00:33:53.713" style="s2">take one more step,</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.313" end="00:33:54.313" style="s2">and don&#39;t blame me for sparing your</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.713" end="00:33:56.213" style="s2">dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.313" end="00:33:57.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, what&#39;s going on here? Is this</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.213" end="00:33:59.313" style="s2">live?</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.713" end="00:34:00.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t it obvious? Mr. Beckett&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.313" end="00:34:02.113" style="s2">stepsister is chasing after him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.713" end="00:34:03.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And at the welcome banquet of all</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.113" end="00:34:04.713" style="s2">places, that desperate to marry into the</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.613" end="00:34:06.313" style="s2">Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.713" end="00:34:07.813" style="s2">So humiliating.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.313" end="00:34:09.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on? How did their</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.813" end="00:34:12.213" style="s2">conversation get onto the living room</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.413" end="00:34:14.013" style="s2">speakers? No. If this keeps up, it&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.213" end="00:34:16.113" style="s2">over. Audrey&#39;s reputation will be</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.013" end="00:34:19.013" style="s2">ruined. And forget about the marriage. I</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.113" end="00:34:19.013" style="s2">have to stop it now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.813" end="00:34:31.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t blame Grant. We we truly love</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.813" end="00:34:33.513" style="s2">each other.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.313" end="00:34:36.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop acting. Everyone knows now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.513" end="00:34:38.613" style="s2">Everyone downstairs heard what you said.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.713" end="00:34:41.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on? Why could the guests</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.613" end="00:34:44.414" style="s2">outside hear what I said in my room?</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.214" end="00:34:46.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, you lose. You couldn&#39;t find me. I</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.414" end="00:34:48.414" style="s2">hid really well, right?</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.714" end="00:34:50.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This little girl stumbled in and</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.414" end="00:34:53.514" style="s2">actually cleared me of suspicion. She</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.214" end="00:34:53.514" style="s2">really is my lucky star.</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.314" end="00:34:57.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry you all had to see that. This is a</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.414" end="00:34:59.614" style="s2">family matter for the Becketts. We&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.914" end="00:35:00.914" style="s2">settle it behind closed doors. Please,</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.614" end="00:35:03.514" style="s2">everyone, head to the main hall. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.914" end="00:35:07.014" style="s2">get back to today&#39;s banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.514" end="00:35:08.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Assistant, I I need the bathroom.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.014" end="00:35:09.814" style="s2">I just need to step out for a bit.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.514" end="00:35:13.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me take you there, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.814" end="00:35:14.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know the way. I can go by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.014" end="00:35:16.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.514" end="00:35:17.814" style="s2">Mr. Beckett gave strict orders to never</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.214" end="00:35:20.514" style="s2">leave your side.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.814" end="00:35:22.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you keep following me, I I&#39;ll tell on</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.514" end="00:35:26.514" style="s2">you for</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.014" end="00:35:29.114" style="s2">for accidentally messing up dad&#39;s suit</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.514" end="00:35:31.514" style="s2">and get you punished by dad.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.114" end="00:35:33.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, how did you know about that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.514" end="00:35:35.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.414" end="00:35:38.014" style="s2">I saw it with my own eyes. So stop</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.814" end="00:35:40.714" style="s2">following me. I&#39;ll be right back after</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.014" end="00:35:40.714" style="s2">the bathroom.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.114" end="00:35:48.514" style="s2">This is no fun at all.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.114" end="00:35:58.314" style="s2">Mommy, Mommy, is that you, Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.714" end="00:36:00.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep your voice down. Don&#39;t let anyone</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:01.714" style="s2">notice.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.514" end="00:36:04.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy?</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.714" end="00:36:05.814" style="s2">Lulu, Lulu missed you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.714" end="00:36:08.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.814" end="00:36:11.814" style="s2">you finally came to get Lulu. I thought</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.214" end="00:36:11.814" style="s2">you didn&#39;t want Lulu anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.114" end="00:36:19.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy missed Lulu so much, too. My baby.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.814" end="00:36:19.114" style="s2">How could Mommy ever not want you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.314" end="00:36:23.614" style="s2">Lulu, Mommy can&#39;t take you away just</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.914" end="00:36:25.914" style="s2">yet. The bad guys haven&#39;t been caught</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.614" end="00:36:27.614" style="s2">yet. Once Mommy beats all the bad guys,</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.914" end="00:36:31.614" style="s2">I&#39;ll come get you. Okay?</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.614" end="00:36:31.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad guys, when will they be caught?</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.114" end="00:36:34.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soon.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.814" end="00:36:34.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, can you help Mommy catch the bad</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.314" end="00:36:37.714" style="s2">guys?</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.814" end="00:36:41.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Lulu. Lulu will help Mommy catch</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.714" end="00:36:43.114" style="s2">all the bad guys. Lulu is super tough.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.714" end="00:36:45.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu,</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.114" end="00:36:48.216" style="s2">later sneak into Grandpa&#39;s study. Put</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.116" end="00:36:50.316" style="s2">this envelope on grandpa&#39;s desk.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.216" end="00:36:52.816" style="s2">Don&#39;t let anyone see you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.316" end="00:36:55.716" style="s2">And don&#39;t tell anyone you saw me, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.816" end="00:36:59.716" style="s2">This is our little secret.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.716" end="00:36:59.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, mission accepted.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.516" end="00:37:05.416" style="s2">Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.616" end="00:37:07.016" style="s2">when are you coming to get me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.416" end="00:37:09.116" style="s2">Lulu wants</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.016" end="00:37:11.116" style="s2">wants to go home with mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.116" end="00:37:12.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our secret signal, do you still remember</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.116" end="00:37:13.816" style="s2">it? When mommy comes to see Lulu, she</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.816" end="00:37:16.516" style="s2">chirps like a bird.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.816" end="00:37:20.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember the secret bird call. Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.516" end="00:37:20.116" style="s2">Lulu will always remember.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.716" end="00:37:33.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, how did you end up here? I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.016" end="00:37:34.016" style="s2">looking for you forever. You scared me</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.116" end="00:37:36.316" style="s2">to death.</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.016" end="00:37:40.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The yard is so big.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.316" end="00:37:40.316" style="s2">I just kept walking and got lost.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.316" end="00:37:50.116" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry, mommy. Lulu will definitely</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.116" end="00:37:50.116" style="s2">get it done. I&#39;m mommy&#39;s little helper.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.316" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two really outdid yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.316" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">You&#39;ve disgraced the Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.016" end="00:38:00.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.216" end="00:38:01.416" style="s2">I really do like Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.616" end="00:38:03.516" style="s2">I</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.416" end="00:38:05.216" style="s2">I just wanted to confess to him. I</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.516" end="00:38:07.316" style="s2">wasn&#39;t trying to cause trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.216" end="00:38:09.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So liking someone means you can play</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.316" end="00:38:10.816" style="s2">dirty and do something this shameless,</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.216" end="00:38:11.716" style="s2">scheming a public forced marriage? Where</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.816" end="00:38:12.516" style="s2">does that leave the Becketts&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.716" end="00:38:13.816" style="s2">reputation?</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.516" end="00:38:15.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russ, Audrey just had a moment of</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.816" end="00:38:17.116" style="s2">confusion. She just loves Grant too</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.616" end="00:38:18.916" style="s2">much. It&#39;s all for the Becketts. She</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.116" end="00:38:20.716" style="s2">wants to grow the family line.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.916" end="00:38:23.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the Becketts? I say it&#39;s for</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.716" end="00:38:25.416" style="s2">yourselves. Let me tell you both, stop</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.116" end="00:38:28.616" style="s2">scheming after Grant. Grant&#39;s marriage</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.416" end="00:38:30.816" style="s2">is none of your business.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.616" end="00:38:32.516" style="s2">Starting today, Audrey is stripped of</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.816" end="00:38:34.316" style="s2">her executive position at the company.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.516" end="00:38:36.216" style="s2">She&#39;s demoted to a grassroots post to</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.316" end="00:38:37.616" style="s2">toughen up and learn what rules really</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.216" end="00:38:39.616" style="s2">mean. All your bank cards are</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.616" end="00:38:41.416" style="s2">confiscated.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.616" end="00:38:43.716" style="s2">You get only basic living expenses each</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.416" end="00:38:43.716" style="s2">month.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.916" end="00:38:48.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared. Don&#39;t be scared. Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.416" end="00:38:49.517" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s going to help Mommy finish her</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.117" end="00:38:51.117" style="s2">mission.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">Lulu is</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.117" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s a brave kid. Can&#39;t be scared.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.517" end="00:39:17.117" style="s2">Mommy, mission complete.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.117" end="00:39:20.317" style="s2">Isn&#39;t Lulu awesome? When are you coming</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.117" end="00:39:20.317" style="s2">to see Lulu again?</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.317" end="00:39:27.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.717" end="00:39:34.617" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this Diane?</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.717" end="00:39:35.617" style="s2">Could Eve really have been wronged back</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.617" end="00:39:37.217" style="s2">then?</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.617" end="00:39:39.217" style="s2">Looks like this is far more complicated</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.217" end="00:39:40.217" style="s2">than it seemed.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.217" end="00:39:41.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.217" end="00:39:45.317" style="s2">you wanted to see me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.617" end="00:39:45.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good timing. Take a look at this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.317" end="00:39:49.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, where did this photo come from? Who</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.117" end="00:39:50.917" style="s2">sent it?</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.617" end="00:39:52.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone must have slipped it into my</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.917" end="00:39:54.717" style="s2">study.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.217" end="00:39:56.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has to be Eve. She&#39;s back. She&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.717" end="00:39:57.717" style="s2">only one who&#39;d dig into that. She&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.417" end="00:39:59.417" style="s2">only one with a motive to send these</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.717" end="00:40:01.317" style="s2">photos. She&#39;s finally ready to face what</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.417" end="00:40:04.117" style="s2">happened back then. Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.317" end="00:40:06.217" style="s2">that thing back then, Eve was framed.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.117" end="00:40:09.017" style="s2">I&#39;ve always suspected it. You should dig</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.217" end="00:40:10.917" style="s2">deep and find out who&#39;s behind this.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.017" end="00:40:11.917" style="s2">Clear Eve&#39;s name and give the Becketts</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.917" end="00:40:14.117" style="s2">an answer.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.917" end="00:40:16.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. We should look into it properly.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.117" end="00:40:17.917" style="s2">After all, Eve is Lulu&#39;s birth mother.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.117" end="00:40:20.317" style="s2">Here&#39;s [music] the thing. Get someone to</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.917" end="00:40:21.517" style="s2">recover the lab&#39;s old server data.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.317" end="00:40:22.417" style="s2">See if there&#39;s any backup of the old</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.517" end="00:40:26.017" style="s2">surveillance footage.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.417" end="00:40:26.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll get on it right away.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.317" end="00:40:36.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That old bastard. Just for that girl, he</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.917" end="00:40:38.417" style="s2">cut off my allowance.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.917" end="00:40:40.617" style="s2">I remember. I remember there was</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.417" end="00:40:43.317" style="s2">definitely a mutton fat jade vase. Where</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.617" end="00:40:43.317" style="s2">did I put it?</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.617" end="00:40:46.917" style="s2">Russell, how does he have this? Who took</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.417" end="00:40:48.018" style="s2">these photos?</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.917" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">Could he have found out the truth</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.018" end="00:40:50.718" style="s2">already?</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.718" end="00:41:04.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what&#39;s wrong? What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.118" end="00:41:05.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in trouble. The old man has photos</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.018" end="00:41:07.918" style="s2">of me entering the lab back then. He</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.718" end="00:41:09.918" style="s2">probably suspects me already.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.918" end="00:41:12.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do? If Dad finds out, he&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.918" end="00:41:14.318" style="s2">send me to prison. Mom, let&#39;s run.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.118" end="00:41:15.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run? Run where?</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.318" end="00:41:17.418" style="s2">All these years, we&#39;ve been living off</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.818" end="00:41:19.818" style="s2">the Becketts and we&#39;ve got no money.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.418" end="00:41:21.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do? Are we just supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.818" end="00:41:22.518" style="s2">sit here and wait for Russell to send us</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.518" end="00:41:24.518" style="s2">to prison?</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.518" end="00:41:25.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I won&#39;t just sit and wait to die.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.518" end="00:41:27.118" style="s2">We&#39;ve built our lives in the Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.518" end="00:41:29.018" style="s2">family for years. Why should we leave?</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.118" end="00:41:30.518" style="s2">If they play dirty, don&#39;t blame us for</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.018" end="00:41:32.218" style="s2">doing the same.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.518" end="00:41:33.718" style="s2">Anyway, your engagement to Grant is</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.218" end="00:41:35.318" style="s2">completely dead, and the old man is</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.718" end="00:41:36.718" style="s2">suspicious of us. If the Becketts treat</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.318" end="00:41:37.718" style="s2">us like this, then don&#39;t blame us for</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.718" end="00:41:40.918" style="s2">showing no mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.718" end="00:41:42.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.918" end="00:41:43.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll find a way to tamper with</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.318" end="00:41:45.718" style="s2">Russell&#39;s tea.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.918" end="00:41:48.518" style="s2">He&#39;s getting old. Soon he won&#39;t be able</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.718" end="00:41:50.218" style="s2">to run things. No one will suspect us.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.518" end="00:41:51.918" style="s2">Once Russell can&#39;t manage the company,</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.218" end="00:41:52.918" style="s2">we quietly transfer the shares. No one</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.918" end="00:41:54.518" style="s2">will ever find out.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.918" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t I think of that? Once we get</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.518" end="00:41:57.818" style="s2">Russell&#39;s half of the shares, who&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:59.718" style="s2">afraid of Grant? Then the whole Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.818" end="00:42:01.718" style="s2">group will be ours.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.718" end="00:42:03.318" style="s2">Okay, let&#39;s do what Mom said. We have no</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.718" end="00:42:05.718" style="s2">way back anyway. Might as well take the</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.318" end="00:42:09.718" style="s2">risk.</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.718" end="00:42:12.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, why are you still sleeping?</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.718" end="00:42:15.918" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s been sleeping so much lately.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.718" end="00:42:19.318" style="s2">He sleeps and sleeps forever. He won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.918" end="00:42:19.318" style="s2">play with Lulu anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.418" end="00:42:22.718" style="s2">Before,</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.618" end="00:42:25.418" style="s2">Grandpa practiced writing with Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.718" end="00:42:30.218" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.418" end="00:42:30.218" style="s2">The secret code, Mommy. Mommy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.718" end="00:42:43.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, how did that thing go last</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.718" end="00:42:44.318" style="s2">time? Did you put the envelope on</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.318" end="00:42:47.018" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s desk?</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.318" end="00:42:49.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mission complete.</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.018" end="00:42:51.518" style="s2">Lulu secretly put put it on Grandpa&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.518" end="00:42:53.220" style="s2">desk. It&#39;s covered. No one noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.518" end="00:42:55.020" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s pretty awesome, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.220" end="00:42:55.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby&#39;s amazing. Your mommy&#39;s best</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.020" end="00:42:58.420" style="s2">little helper.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.620" end="00:42:59.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, grandpa&#39;s been sleeping all day.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.420" end="00:43:01.420" style="s2">Lulu won&#39;t wake up no matter how much</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.820" end="00:43:03.020" style="s2">you call. She&#39;s always like this, sleeps</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.420" end="00:43:06.520" style="s2">like a rock. Even when he wakes, he has</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.020" end="00:43:07.920" style="s2">no strength. Is grandpa sick?</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.520" end="00:43:09.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; always been in good health. He wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.920" end="00:43:11.420" style="s2">just fall back asleep for no reason. Is</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.820" end="00:43:13.520" style="s2">anyone home? Are the servants here?</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.420" end="00:43:15.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody&#39;s here. The butler went to get</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.520" end="00:43:16.520" style="s2">the letters. The maid&#39;s busy in the</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.320" end="00:43:19.020" style="s2">kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.520" end="00:43:21.120" style="s2">She&#39;ll be back soon.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.020" end="00:43:22.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to check on Russell.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.120" end="00:43:25.820" style="s2">If someone really tampered with it,</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.720" end="00:43:25.820" style="s2">that&#39;s way too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.820" end="00:43:33.420" style="s2">His lips are dark with a purplish tint.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.120" end="00:43:35.120" style="s2">His breathing&#39;s off, too. Too slow, too</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.420" end="00:43:37.520" style="s2">heavy. This isn&#39;t how normal sleep</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.120" end="00:43:37.520" style="s2">looks.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.020" end="00:43:41.920" style="s2">His body&#39;s being worn down slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.520" end="00:43:45.620" style="s2">Someone&#39;s clearly behind this. Who&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.920" end="00:43:45.620" style="s2">this bold to do this to Russell?</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.320" end="00:43:51.320" style="s2">The problem is in this tea. Drink it</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.320" end="00:43:54.920" style="s2">long enough, and his mind will keep</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.320" end="00:43:54.920" style="s2">fading till he can&#39;t get up at all.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.220" end="00:43:57.770" style="s2">Shh. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.920" end="00:44:02.820" style="s2">Lulu, grandpa&#39;s fine. He&#39;s just asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.820" end="00:44:04.620" style="s2">When grandpa wakes up, remember to tell</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.820" end="00:44:06.520" style="s2">him to drink less tea. Best if he stops</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.620" end="00:44:07.820" style="s2">drinking tea altogether. Got it? You</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.520" end="00:44:08.420" style="s2">must make sure grandpa stops drinking</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.820" end="00:44:10.820" style="s2">this tea.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.420" end="00:44:15.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it, mommy. Lulu will tell grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.820" end="00:44:15.320" style="s2">for sure. No more tea for him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.620" end="00:44:26.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long was I asleep?</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.720" end="00:44:28.420" style="s2">Why do I feel more tired the more I</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.020" end="00:44:28.420" style="s2">sleep?</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.220" end="00:44:34.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re awake. Why do you look so</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.320" end="00:44:37.520" style="s2">pale? Are you feeling unwell?</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.320" end="00:44:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, grandpa slept all afternoon. Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.520" end="00:44:43.520" style="s2">couldn&#39;t wake him no matter what.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.520" end="00:44:45.420" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s so bored all alone.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.520" end="00:44:47.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s grandpa&#39;s fault. Next time,</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.420" end="00:44:49.720" style="s2">grandpa won&#39;t sleep so long and play</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.320" end="00:44:49.720" style="s2">with Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.220" end="00:44:54.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa,</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.320" end="00:44:56.021" style="s2">no more tea tea.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.020" end="00:44:58.021" style="s2">Drinking it and sleeping all the time</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.021" end="00:44:59.821" style="s2">will make you sick.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.021" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl, tea is what keeps me awake.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.821" end="00:45:02.221" style="s2">After tea, grandpa won&#39;t be sleeping.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.321" end="00:45:04.721" style="s2">How could he sleep at a time like this?</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.221" end="00:45:06.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. You can&#39;t You can&#39;t drink tea,</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.721" end="00:45:06.521" style="s2">tea. Grandpa just can&#39;t drink it</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.021" end="00:45:08.421" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.521" end="00:45:10.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay. Grandpa won&#39;t drink it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.421" end="00:45:11.621" style="s2">Whatever our Lulu says, just leave it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.121" end="00:45:13.121" style="s2">I&#39;ll drink it later.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.621" end="00:45:14.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father&#39;s always been in good health. How</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.121" end="00:45:16.821" style="s2">could he suddenly sleep all day and get</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.621" end="00:45:18.121" style="s2">weaker? And Lulu keeps stopping him from</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.821" end="00:45:18.621" style="s2">drinking tea. This is definitely not</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.121" end="00:45:20.521" style="s2">that simple.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.621" end="00:45:22.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, why call a doctor out of nowhere?</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.521" end="00:45:23.921" style="s2">Is Lulu feeling sick? Is it serious?</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.221" end="00:45:24.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. Lulu has an upset stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.921" end="00:45:26.321" style="s2">Better have a doctor check her. If</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.821" end="00:45:26.921" style="s2">that&#39;s all, head back. Don&#39;t hang</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.321" end="00:45:29.221" style="s2">around.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.921" end="00:45:29.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.221" end="00:45:34.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strange. Blood pressure and heart rate</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.121" end="00:45:38.421" style="s2">are both normal. Take a look at this</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.921" end="00:45:38.421" style="s2">tea. Is there anything wrong with it?</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.121" end="00:45:41.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The tea has dangerously this out and</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.521" end="00:45:42.921" style="s2">it&#39;ll damage the brain. It could even be</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.821" end="00:45:44.721" style="s2">life-threatening.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.921" end="00:45:47.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To think someone dared to poison right</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.721" end="00:45:49.521" style="s2">under my nose. Good. Just great. I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.221" end="00:45:50.821" style="s2">like to see who&#39;s got the guts daring to</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.521" end="00:45:52.921" style="s2">pull tricks on the Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.821" end="00:45:55.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be scared, grandpa. Lulu will</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.921" end="00:45:55.521" style="s2">protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.721" end="00:46:00.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu,</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.821" end="00:46:02.721" style="s2">why won&#39;t you let grandpa drink his tea?</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.321" end="00:46:04.921" style="s2">Who told you tea is bad for you? Did</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.721" end="00:46:06.121" style="s2">someone say something to you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.921" end="00:46:08.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.121" end="00:46:09.921" style="s2">tea keeps you awake, right? Lulu figured</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.621" end="00:46:12.421" style="s2">it out herself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.921" end="00:46:14.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has Lulu met anyone lately</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.421" end="00:46:16.621" style="s2">like mom?</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.121" end="00:46:17.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Lulu didn&#39;t see anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.621" end="00:46:20.921" style="s2">Daddy, don&#39;t guess.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.921" end="00:46:22.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It really is you, Eve. You&#39;re back and</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.921" end="00:46:23.921" style="s2">you&#39;ve been secretly watching over Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.221" end="00:46:25.621" style="s2">and the family all along. You&#39;re the one</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.921" end="00:46:27.121" style="s2">who found the problem with the tea too,</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.621" end="00:46:28.721" style="s2">right? Have people keep a close watch on</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.121" end="00:46:30.021" style="s2">the old mansion&#39;s courtyard, especially</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.721" end="00:46:31.921" style="s2">the corner by the courtyard wall. See</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.021" end="00:46:32.921" style="s2">who Lulu has been meeting lately. Report</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.921" end="00:46:34.621" style="s2">to me the moment you have anything.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.921" end="00:46:35.621" style="s2">Remember, don&#39;t alert them.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.621" end="00:46:37.521" style="s2">Just watch from a distance.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.621" end="00:46:39.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Beckett. I&#39;ll get men on it</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.521" end="00:46:39.921" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.421" end="00:46:46.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, five years, there&#39;s so much I want</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.021" end="00:46:46.421" style="s2">to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.521" end="00:46:54.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three long chirps, one short, that&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.221" end="00:46:55.823" style="s2">signal Lulu and I agreed on. When Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.421" end="00:46:58.122" style="s2">comes out, I can ask her what&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.823" end="00:47:00.422" style="s2">going on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.122" end="00:47:02.823" style="s2">Lulu answered me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.422" end="00:47:04.422" style="s2">Lulu, mommy missed you so much. Have you</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.823" end="00:47:05.723" style="s2">been good and listening to grandpa? You</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.422" end="00:47:07.523" style="s2">didn&#39;t let grandpa drink the tea, did</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.723" end="00:47:08.823" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.523" end="00:47:12.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve,</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.823" end="00:47:12.023" style="s2">long time no see.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.523" end="00:47:17.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know the signal Lulu and I</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.823" end="00:47:17.122" style="s2">use?</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.422" end="00:47:21.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard it of course. And how did I not</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.723" end="00:47:23.723" style="s2">know that the Beckett estate has two</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.922" end="00:47:26.723" style="s2">chirping little birds?</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.723" end="00:47:26.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.122" end="00:47:33.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I missed you so much, Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.523" end="00:47:35.622" style="s2">Could you please</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.023" end="00:47:35.622" style="s2">come back to me?</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.922" end="00:47:40.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have nothing to talk about.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.523" end="00:47:45.023" style="s2">Back then you chose to believe Diane and</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.023" end="00:47:46.523" style="s2">the others,</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.023" end="00:47:48.723" style="s2">but you wouldn&#39;t believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.523" end="00:47:50.523" style="s2">What&#39;s the point of saying all this now?</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.723" end="00:47:52.823" style="s2">All those days of being wronged, I</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.523" end="00:47:54.422" style="s2">carried it all alone.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.823" end="00:47:56.323" style="s2">I&#39;m long past being the Eve who&#39;d wait</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.422" end="00:47:57.523" style="s2">for you to come back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.323" end="00:47:59.223" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to get tangled up with you</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.523" end="00:48:00.723" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.223" end="00:48:04.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.723" end="00:48:05.723" style="s2">At least give me a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.023" end="00:48:07.422" style="s2">All these years I searched for you like</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.723" end="00:48:10.122" style="s2">a madman. I turned the whole city upside</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.422" end="00:48:11.122" style="s2">down. Not a single day have I ever let</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.122" end="00:48:13.323" style="s2">you go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:16.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me? Heartless? When you all wronged me</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.323" end="00:48:18.523" style="s2">back then, whoever listened to my side?</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.122" end="00:48:19.723" style="s2">And you, Grant, you didn&#39;t believe me</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.523" end="00:48:21.422" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.723" end="00:48:23.823" style="s2">Is that the kind of person I am in your</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.422" end="00:48:23.823" style="s2">eyes?</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.823" end="00:48:37.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.523" end="00:48:38.622" style="s2">What happened back then involved Beckett</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.122" end="00:48:40.523" style="s2">Group&#39;s core secrets. I was too</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.622" end="00:48:42.323" style="s2">impulsive, too hotheaded to check if the</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.523" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">footage was real. It&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.323" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.422" end="00:48:49.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is a simple sorry enough?</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.422" end="00:48:51.223" style="s2">When I was thrown out, I had nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.422" end="00:48:53.223" style="s2">Pregnant with Lulu, living in a rundown</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.223" end="00:48:55.023" style="s2">rental, burning up with fever, nearly</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.223" end="00:48:57.622" style="s2">passing out, and no one cared. Where</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.023" end="00:48:57.622" style="s2">were you then?</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.723" end="00:49:01.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I &#39;m sorry, Eve.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.422" end="00:49:04.124" style="s2">I left you out there suffering all</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.624" end="00:49:04.124" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.624" end="00:49:08.124" style="s2">From now on, I will never let you or our</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.424" end="00:49:09.124" style="s2">child suffer the slightest again. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.124" end="00:49:10.524" style="s2">already had people start a full</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.124" end="00:49:12.324" style="s2">investigation into what happened back</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.524" end="00:49:14.124" style="s2">then. All the pain you and Lulu went</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.324" end="00:49:17.224" style="s2">through these years, I&#39;ll make them pay</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.124" end="00:49:19.024" style="s2">back a hundred times over.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.224" end="00:49:21.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already had Lulu put the photos in</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.024" end="00:49:22.524" style="s2">grandpa&#39;s study. When the time comes,</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.224" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">with all this evidence laid out before</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.524" end="00:49:26.524" style="s2">Diane, she won&#39;t be able to deny it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:28.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it was you who had Lulu put those</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.524" end="00:49:30.324" style="s2">photos in the study.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.024" end="00:49:31.324" style="s2">And grandpa&#39;s tea, you told Lulu about</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.324" end="00:49:32.624" style="s2">that too.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.324" end="00:49:36.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll definitely try something again</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.624" end="00:49:36.424" style="s2">soon, mother and daughter. Be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.524" end="00:49:41.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you worried about me, Evie?</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.224" end="00:49:43.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I&#39;m not. It&#39;s getting late. I should</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.624" end="00:49:43.924" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.124" end="00:49:56.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, no more tea today, okay? Too</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.524" end="00:49:58.824" style="s2">much tea makes you sleep forever. Then</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.224" end="00:50:01.124" style="s2">you can&#39;t play with Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.824" end="00:50:04.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay. Grandpa won&#39;t drink whatever</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.124" end="00:50:06.224" style="s2">our Lulu says.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.024" end="00:50:08.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russell, fresh dragon whale tea. Give it</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.224" end="00:50:09.524" style="s2">a taste.</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.024" end="00:50:12.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.524" end="00:50:14.624" style="s2">You&#39;ve had enough today. You can&#39;t drink</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.024" end="00:50:18.524" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.624" end="00:50:20.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu really cares so much about grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:22.924" style="s2">In just half a month, Russell&#39;s body</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.824" end="00:50:26.624" style="s2">will completely collapse. Then taking</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.924" end="00:50:26.624" style="s2">over the Becketts will be easy for us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.924" end="00:50:31.324" style="s2">Russell, one cup now and then won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.924" end="00:50:31.324" style="s2">hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.924" end="00:50:36.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this bad woman is the one trying to</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.124" end="00:50:39.524" style="s2">harm grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.924" end="00:50:43.124" style="s2">Bad woman trying to hurt grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.524" end="00:50:43.124" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how Lulu deals with you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.224" end="00:50:50.824" style="s2">Grandpa, you&#39;ve had plenty today.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.524" end="00:50:52.724" style="s2">Let grandma Diane drink this cup.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.824" end="00:50:55.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with you? Going crazy on a</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.724" end="00:50:55.324" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:51:00.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t mean it. My hand just slipped.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.124" end="00:51:02.925" style="s2">Lulu, get up now. Grandma didn&#39;t push</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.525" end="00:51:02.925" style="s2">you on purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.525" end="00:51:10.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry, Lulu. Daddy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.125" end="00:51:11.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, don&#39;t cry. Don&#39;t cry. Whoever hits</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.325" end="00:51:14.625" style="s2">Lulu, grandpa hits them.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.725" end="00:51:17.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s this bad grandma. She bullied Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.625" end="00:51:19.825" style="s2">Lulu doesn&#39;t want to see her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.125" end="00:51:21.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Diane, go upstairs and stay there. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.825" end="00:51:23.725" style="s2">come down without my permission.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.425" end="00:51:25.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was an accident, and Lucy isn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.725" end="00:51:27.925" style="s2">hurt, is she? Is there really any need</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.725" end="00:51:30.525" style="s2">to make such a big deal out of it?</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.925" end="00:51:32.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You call this not hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.525" end="00:51:34.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you standing there for? Go to</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.225" end="00:51:34.725" style="s2">your room.</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.925" end="00:51:43.325" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong, Lulu? Does it still hurt</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.925" end="00:51:43.325" style="s2">somewhere?</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.725" end="00:51:47.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t hurt anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.725" end="00:51:50.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong, Lulu? Does it still hurt</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.625" end="00:51:50.025" style="s2">somewhere?</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.425" end="00:51:54.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t hurt anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.525" end="00:51:55.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why is Lulu unhappy? Were you</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.425" end="00:51:57.025" style="s2">scared?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.725" end="00:51:58.725" style="s2">Daddy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.025" end="00:52:02.925" style="s2">Nobody&#39;s going to bully you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.725" end="00:52:02.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can daddy protect Lulu no matter what?</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.725" end="00:52:07.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Daddy will never let anything</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.925" end="00:52:10.525" style="s2">happen to Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.925" end="00:52:12.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what if one day Lulu gets framed</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.525" end="00:52:16.525" style="s2">like mommy was?</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.925" end="00:52:16.525" style="s2">Will daddy still protect Lulu?</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.025" end="00:52:24.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then, Eve looked at me with those</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.925" end="00:52:27.025" style="s2">same eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.525" end="00:52:30.225" style="s2">Daddy promises, no matter when, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.025" end="00:52:33.825" style="s2">always believe in Lulu and your mom.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.225" end="00:52:33.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s the best to Lulu.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.025" end="00:52:38.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, get home right now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.925" end="00:52:44.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, what&#39;s wrong? Why do you call me</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.425" end="00:52:45.925" style="s2">back in such a hurry?</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.425" end="00:52:47.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucy&#39;s been with the Becketts only days,</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.925" end="00:52:48.525" style="s2">and already dares to trample his mother</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.225" end="00:52:49.925" style="s2">and daughter. That old bastard Russell</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.525" end="00:52:51.325" style="s2">actually chewed me out for her today,</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.925" end="00:52:52.525" style="s2">and Grant chimed in too. Does he really</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.325" end="00:52:55.025" style="s2">think we&#39;re easy to push around?</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.525" end="00:52:56.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, don&#39;t be mad. That old bastard</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.025" end="00:52:58.425" style="s2">Russell just got lucky, and he still</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.525" end="00:53:00.625" style="s2">won&#39;t close his eyes, and Lucy got the</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.425" end="00:53:02.425" style="s2">upper hand again.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.625" end="00:53:04.525" style="s2">I say we can&#39;t wait another half month,</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.425" end="00:53:04.827" style="s2">or sooner or later it&#39;ll all come out.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.525" end="00:53:07.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.827" end="00:53:08.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; do we do now? That girl keeps a tight</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.127" end="00:53:10.627" style="s2">watch on Russell&#39;s food now. We can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.827" end="00:53:13.127" style="s2">get nearer at all.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.627" end="00:53:14.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, since we can&#39;t get to Russell,</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.127" end="00:53:15.527" style="s2">let&#39;s make that girl drive herself out</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.727" end="00:53:16.727" style="s2">of the Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.527" end="00:53:18.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do we do that?</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.727" end="00:53:19.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That old man of the Fosters is upright</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.427" end="00:53:21.427" style="s2">and honorable. He hates illegitimate</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.827" end="00:53:22.827" style="s2">children and scandals like that. If we</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.427" end="00:53:24.727" style="s2">announce at Mr. Foster&#39;s birthday</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.827" end="00:53:26.627" style="s2">banquet that Lucy is Grant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.727" end="00:53:28.427" style="s2">illegitimate daughter, Mr. Foster will</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.627" end="00:53:30.927" style="s2">definitely be unhappy with the Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.427" end="00:53:32.327" style="s2">Forget Lucy, even Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.927" end="00:53:34.427" style="s2">The Fosters won&#39;t give him the time of</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.327" end="00:53:36.527" style="s2">day anymore. Once they lose the Fosters&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.427" end="00:53:39.327" style="s2">backing, the Becketts will be ours,</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.527" end="00:53:41.527" style="s2">mother and daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.327" end="00:53:43.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re so thoughtful, dear. Why didn&#39;t I</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.527" end="00:53:44.427" style="s2">think of that?</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.327" end="00:53:46.127" style="s2">The Fosters and the Becketts are</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.427" end="00:53:47.827" style="s2">partners now. They care about their</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.127" end="00:53:50.027" style="s2">reputation. Now they won&#39;t even have a</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.827" end="00:53:51.727" style="s2">way out.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.027" end="00:53:53.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Foster&#39;s birthday banquet is in</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.727" end="00:53:54.927" style="s2">three days. All the important Becketts</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.627" end="00:53:57.227" style="s2">will be there.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.927" end="00:53:59.627" style="s2">We&#39;ll have someone spread the rumor</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.227" end="00:54:01.727" style="s2">and let everyone see that Russell&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.627" end="00:54:04.427" style="s2">precious granddaughter</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.727" end="00:54:05.727" style="s2">is just a child of questionable origin.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.427" end="00:54:07.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing I planted a recorder in</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.727" end="00:54:09.627" style="s2">Diane&#39;s room. As soon as I knew she was</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.927" end="00:54:11.227" style="s2">poisoning him, I never thought this</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.627" end="00:54:15.527" style="s2">mother and daughter could be so vicious.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.227" end="00:54:15.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, do you like Lulu&#39;s new dress?</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.327" end="00:54:20.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful. Lulu looks beautiful in</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.427" end="00:54:22.327" style="s2">anything. I&#39;ll make sure Diane and</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.127" end="00:54:26.227" style="s2">Audrey pay the price for this.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.327" end="00:54:26.227" style="s2">They&#39;ll never hurt Lucy or Eve again.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.827" end="00:54:35.327" style="s2">Grant&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.627" end="00:54:42.327" style="s2">Oh my, whose little darling is this? So</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.527" end="00:54:45.127" style="s2">pretty. Can Grandpa give you a hug?</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.327" end="00:54:47.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu wants Grandpa&#39;s hug.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.127" end="00:54:48.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So your name is Lulu. What an adorable</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.427" end="00:54:50.627" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.927" end="00:54:52.027" style="s2">Russell, you have such a lovely</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.627" end="00:54:53.827" style="s2">granddaughter. Why didn&#39;t you tell me</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.027" end="00:54:55.227" style="s2">sooner? Afraid I&#39;d steal her away?</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.827" end="00:54:57.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just got back from the hospital. No</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.227" end="00:55:00.627" style="s2">time to tell you, right?</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.327" end="00:55:03.227" style="s2">So today I brought Lulu over.</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.627" end="00:55:05.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa, take good care of your health.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.227" end="00:55:07.928" style="s2">Eat till you&#39;re full like Lulu does and</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.827" end="00:55:10.328" style="s2">sleep nice and sound.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.928" end="00:55:13.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, good, good. Grandpa will do</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.328" end="00:55:15.628" style="s2">whatever Lulu says. Good, good, good.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.628" end="00:55:17.628" style="s2">Grandpa will do whatever Lulu says.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.628" end="00:55:20.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s dinner time anyway, everyone. Take</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.628" end="00:55:20.128" style="s2">your seats.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.628" end="00:55:24.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eating every day.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.428" end="00:55:25.528" style="s2">When will you give me a grandchild to</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.028" end="00:55:26.928" style="s2">hold?</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.528" end="00:55:28.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, since when do you have a</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.928" end="00:55:29.728" style="s2">daughter? Weren&#39;t we supposed to stay</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.228" end="00:55:30.228" style="s2">single together? You actually betrayed</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.728" end="00:55:33.428" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.228" end="00:55:33.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;d better hurry up, too.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.128" end="00:55:41.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t expect this girl to even win over</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.228" end="00:55:43.528" style="s2">Mr. Foster. When do we make our move?</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.428" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. I&#39;ve already arranged people in</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.528" end="00:55:46.128" style="s2">advance. Once the banquet starts and</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.128" end="00:55:47.928" style="s2">we&#39;re halfway through eating, the news</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.128" end="00:55:49.728" style="s2">will spread and everyone at the party</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.928" end="00:55:52.528" style="s2">will know. Then we just sit back and</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.728" end="00:55:52.528" style="s2">enjoy the show.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.528" end="00:55:57.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, don&#39;t reach for the food. Just</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.928" end="00:55:59.428" style="s2">tell Daddy what you want and I&#39;ll get it</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.228" end="00:55:59.428" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.028" end="00:56:03.128" style="s2">Lulu, don&#39;t reach for the food. Just</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.728" end="00:56:03.428" style="s2">tell Daddy what you want and I&#39;ll get it</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.128" end="00:56:05.328" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.428" end="00:56:06.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Grandpa will get it for you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.328" end="00:56:10.428" style="s2">What does Lulu want to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.428" end="00:56:10.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing here that Lulu wants.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.128" end="00:56:15.028" style="s2">I want that one.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.628" end="00:56:18.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Daddy will get it for</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.028" end="00:56:18.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu wants to do it herself.</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.128" end="00:56:23.628" style="s2">Which one should Lulu pick?</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.128" end="00:56:23.628" style="s2">This one.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.128" end="00:56:27.828" style="s2">This bunny cake is so good.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.228" end="00:56:36.228" style="s2">Who are you? Give me back my cake.</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.128" end="00:56:36.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My cake.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.528" end="00:56:40.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your son grabbed Lulu&#39;s cake.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.828" end="00:56:46.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.428" end="00:56:46.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Lucy.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.128" end="00:56:51.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since when does my child</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.328" end="00:56:53.028" style="s2">have nobody to love her?</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.728" end="00:56:54.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, Grant.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.028" end="00:56:57.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.428" end="00:56:59.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, is what she says true?</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.028" end="00:57:00.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, let&#39;s see how you explain this</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.228" end="00:57:03.128" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.328" end="00:57:04.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Foster, Lucy is no illegitimate</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.128" end="00:57:06.228" style="s2">daughter. She&#39;s the legitimate</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.628" end="00:57:08.328" style="s2">granddaughter of the Becketts. You know</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.228" end="00:57:08.828" style="s2">the Becketts business so well. Who told</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.328" end="00:57:09.429" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.828" end="00:57:10.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never mind how I</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.429" end="00:57:12.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; know.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.129" end="00:57:14.204" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is what she said true?</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.429" end="00:57:16.224" style="s2">No, it&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.204" end="00:57:16.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.629" end="00:57:27.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Lucy&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.529" end="00:57:27.229" style="s2">I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.329" end="00:57:32.329" style="s2">Who gives outsiders the right to</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.729" end="00:57:34.429" style="s2">badmouth my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.329" end="00:57:35.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, isn&#39;t that Eve?</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.429" end="00:57:36.929" style="s2">She leaked Beckett group secrets back</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.829" end="00:57:37.929" style="s2">then. Didn&#39;t she drown herself in the</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.929" end="00:57:40.429" style="s2">sea long ago?</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.929" end="00:57:44.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Eve&#39;s been dead for years. How is</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.429" end="00:57:44.029" style="s2">she standing here alive and well?</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.929" end="00:57:49.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.029" end="00:57:52.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.429" end="00:57:56.229" style="s2">Don&#39;t cry, Lulu. Mommy&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.829" end="00:57:58.929" style="s2">No one will bully you again.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.229" end="00:58:00.729" style="s2">I, Eve, am Lucy&#39;s rightful mother. Once</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.929" end="00:58:01.729" style="s2">the Becketts acknowledge me, Grant and I</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.729" end="00:58:03.529" style="s2">are lawfully married.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.729" end="00:58:05.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.529" end="00:58:07.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.529" end="00:58:09.829" style="s2">That my daughter is an unwanted bastard</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.429" end="00:58:09.829" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.529" end="00:58:15.429" style="s2">Looks like this whole smear campaign was</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.329" end="00:58:18.229" style="s2">scripted long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.429" end="00:58:19.529" style="s2">Just waiting for us.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.229" end="00:58:22.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve,</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.529" end="00:58:22.529" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.629" end="00:58:33.829" style="s2">That girl&#39;s only been at the Beckett&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.929" end="00:58:35.129" style="s2">few days and she dares to trample all</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.829" end="00:58:36.929" style="s2">over us, mother and daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.129" end="00:58:38.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once we spread the news at Mr. Foster&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.929" end="00:58:40.529" style="s2">birthday banquet that Lucy is Grant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.829" end="00:58:44.429" style="s2">bastard child.</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.529" end="00:58:44.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really thought it through, dear.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.229" end="00:58:49.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a vicious mother-daughter pair,</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.729" end="00:58:52.929" style="s2">scheming like this at my own birthday</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.429" end="00:58:56.329" style="s2">banquet. Someone, throw them out.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.929" end="00:58:56.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.329" end="00:59:01.129" style="s2">That recording is fake.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.029" end="00:59:02.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, this is all a misunderstanding. I</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.129" end="00:59:04.529" style="s2">would never do such a thing. The</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.229" end="00:59:07.429" style="s2">recording must be fake. It&#39;s doctored.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.529" end="00:59:07.429" style="s2">You have to believe me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.529" end="00:59:10.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me go. Let me go. I&#39;m one of the</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.729" end="00:59:13.429" style="s2">Becketts.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.429" end="00:59:13.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, save</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.931" end="00:59:19.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu has a mom. Mommy&#39;s right here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.131" end="00:59:28.031" style="s2">Our Lulu is a good girl with a mom.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.731" end="00:59:28.031" style="s2">Mommy will always be here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.531" end="00:59:33.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all taken care of. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.531" end="00:59:35.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking Lulu home.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.331" end="00:59:36.031" style="s2">Lulu went through such a shock. I have</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.031" end="00:59:37.531" style="s2">to be by her side.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.031" end="00:59:38.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too far from the city here. Lulu</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.531" end="00:59:39.731" style="s2">can&#39;t handle such a long drive. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.831" end="00:59:41.231" style="s2">take you both to stay at the Becket</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.731" end="00:59:44.331" style="s2">estate. The rooms there are already.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.231" end="00:59:44.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going to the Beckets.</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.731" end="00:59:49.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want mommy and daddy together.</p>
<p begin="00:59:47.931" end="00:59:53.031" style="s2">Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.031" end="00:59:54.731" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s so so sleepy. Lulu wants to</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.031" end="00:59:57.231" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.731" end="00:59:59.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? Lulu&#39;s exhausted. Why not just stay</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.231" end="01:00:01.031" style="s2">at the Beckets tonight? Save Lulu the</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.431" end="01:00:04.231" style="s2">back and forth. She&#39;s too little to</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.031" end="01:00:04.231" style="s2">handle all that running around.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.231" end="01:00:10.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine then.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.731" end="01:00:30.431" style="s2">You&#39;ve carried her all this way. Let me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.431" end="01:00:32.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you worried about me? Lulu&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.431" end="01:00:33.931" style="s2">heavy. I can handle this much.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.231" end="01:00:36.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s worried about you? Don&#39;t flatter</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.931" end="01:00:36.531" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.731" end="01:00:45.831" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you leaving?</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.531" end="01:00:51.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest assured, nothing like that will</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.431" end="01:00:54.731" style="s2">ever happen again. And the truth about</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.131" end="01:00:54.731" style="s2">back then will come out soon.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.831" end="01:00:58.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you not believe me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.431" end="01:00:59.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong back then. I let false</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.331" end="01:01:01.131" style="s2">appearances cloud my judgment. I</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.631" end="01:01:02.831" style="s2">misunderstood you without looking into</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.131" end="01:01:05.231" style="s2">it. Now I want to make it up to you and</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.831" end="01:01:07.831" style="s2">Lulu. Can I? I&#39;ll wait for the day you</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.231" end="01:01:07.831" style="s2">can answer me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.132" end="01:01:22.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did Eve just suddenly show up? We</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.132" end="01:01:23.932" style="s2">planned it perfectly. She wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.632" end="01:01:25.832" style="s2">supposed to come at all. And that</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.932" end="01:01:28.132" style="s2">recording, Grant actually set a trap</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.832" end="01:01:29.732" style="s2">long ago, waiting for us to fall in.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.132" end="01:01:31.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, the Becketts have teamed up to plot</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.732" end="01:01:33.832" style="s2">against us. What do we do? That old</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.732" end="01:01:35.332" style="s2">geezer, Russell. He&#39;s clearly siding</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.832" end="01:01:37.432" style="s2">with Eve now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.332" end="01:01:39.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, calm down. As long as there&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.432" end="01:01:41.732" style="s2">evidence, Russell can&#39;t do a thing to</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.732" end="01:01:43.332" style="s2">us. But Eve showing up today means she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.732" end="01:01:44.732" style="s2">definitely in cahoots with Grant.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.332" end="01:01:45.732" style="s2">Otherwise, why such a coincidence? They</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.732" end="01:01:46.232" style="s2">must be digging into the truth from back</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.732" end="01:01:47.832" style="s2">then now.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.232" end="01:01:48.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do we do? We can&#39;t just sit and</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.832" end="01:01:50.532" style="s2">wait to die.</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.632" end="01:01:52.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll have to go after that girl,</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.532" end="01:01:55.232" style="s2">Lucy.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.332" end="01:01:57.332" style="s2">Once all their attention is on Lucy,</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.232" end="01:01:59.432" style="s2">they won&#39;t have time to investigate.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.332" end="01:02:01.532" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll figure out a way to erase</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.432" end="01:02:04.132" style="s2">every trace from back then.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.532" end="01:02:06.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the quick thinker, dear. Right.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.132" end="01:02:08.032" style="s2">Let&#39;s go after that little girl. I want</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.332" end="01:02:11.732" style="s2">to see how Eve stays in the Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.032" end="01:02:11.732" style="s2">family without that little girl.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.032" end="01:02:20.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, you&#39;re finally awake. Lulu missed</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.532" end="01:02:23.332" style="s2">you so much.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.132" end="01:02:23.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I missed you too, Lulu.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.732" end="01:02:28.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, Lulu&#39;s hungry.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.032" end="01:02:30.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Let&#39;s go downstairs for</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.332" end="01:02:30.832" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.332" end="01:02:38.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just made this.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.732" end="01:02:39.832" style="s2">Come, try it. Is it good?</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.632" end="01:02:42.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.832" end="01:02:42.832" style="s2">feed Lulu.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.532" end="01:02:53.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat slowly. Don&#39;t choke.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.832" end="01:02:57.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy&#39;s cooking is so good.</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.432" end="01:02:57.632" style="s2">Lulu can&#39;t help eating a bit more.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.932" end="01:03:05.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday, Lulu was called a kid with no</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.232" end="01:03:07.132" style="s2">mom, right in public. Good thing you</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.432" end="01:03:08.532" style="s2">came in time. Otherwise, those people</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.132" end="01:03:11.332" style="s2">would really have laughed at Lulu.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.532" end="01:03:12.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, after breakfast, you and Grant come</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.332" end="01:03:14.732" style="s2">to my room.</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.932" end="01:03:16.432" style="s2">I have something to say to you too.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.732" end="01:03:17.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back then, Grant&#39;s father was very</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.432" end="01:03:19.333" style="s2">disappointed in me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.832" end="01:03:20.533" style="s2">His attitude now.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.333" end="01:03:22.933" style="s2">Maybe there&#39;s a lead on what happened</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.533" end="01:03:22.933" style="s2">back then.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.133" end="01:03:30.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One Lucy is enough.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.133" end="01:03:33.533" style="s2">Now Eve&#39;s here too. Is there still a</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.233" end="01:03:33.533" style="s2">place for me in this family?</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.833" end="01:03:36.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russell must be doing it for Lucy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.433" end="01:03:38.033" style="s2">sake.</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.633" end="01:03:38.333" style="s2">That&#39;s the only reason he let Eve sit</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.033" end="01:03:40.833" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.333" end="01:03:42.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Once I go over there and</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.833" end="01:03:44.033" style="s2">bring up the past, Russell will</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.133" end="01:03:46.433" style="s2">definitely make Eve leave.</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.033" end="01:03:49.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my. How come I didn&#39;t know our family</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.433" end="01:03:49.633" style="s2">has one more person?</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.733" end="01:03:53.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve,</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.733" end="01:03:54.833" style="s2">even if you have Lucy, you can&#39;t think a</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.533" end="01:03:56.133" style="s2">child will get you into this family.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.833" end="01:03:57.633" style="s2">After all, you leaked company secrets</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.133" end="01:03:59.433" style="s2">back then. As far as I, the Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.633" end="01:04:00.933" style="s2">matriarch, I&#39;m concerned, there&#39;s no way</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.433" end="01:04:03.333" style="s2">you&#39;re setting foot in this house.</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.933" end="01:04:05.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was the one who set me up back then,</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.333" end="01:04:10.233" style="s2">and now she has the nerve to say that.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.933" end="01:04:10.233" style="s2">Twisting everything around. Shameless.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.433" end="01:04:14.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma, that&#39;s a lie. Mom never did any</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.433" end="01:04:16.733" style="s2">of that.</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.633" end="01:04:18.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adults are talking. Kids shouldn&#39;t butt</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.733" end="01:04:19.633" style="s2">in. Get out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.333" end="01:04:21.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I recall grandpa&#39;s punishment for you</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.633" end="01:04:22.533" style="s2">isn&#39;t over yet, is it? Weren&#39;t you told</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.433" end="01:04:24.733" style="s2">to reflect in your room?</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.533" end="01:04:26.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russell, Grant, don&#39;t let this woman</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.733" end="01:04:27.833" style="s2">fool you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.233" end="01:04:29.833" style="s2">She dared to leak the company&#39;s core</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.833" end="01:04:31.633" style="s2">secrets. Who knows what else she&#39;ll do</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.833" end="01:04:33.333" style="s2">to hurt the Becketts.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.633" end="01:04:35.733" style="s2">Someone like her doesn&#39;t deserve to be a</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.333" end="01:04:35.733" style="s2">Beckett.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.633" end="01:04:41.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Becketts family business. Since when</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.833" end="01:04:43.033" style="s2">does an outsider get to boss us around?</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.233" end="01:04:43.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been married to you for years. How</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.033" end="01:04:45.433" style="s2">am I an outsider?</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.933" end="01:04:47.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you pulled at Mr. Foster&#39;s birthday</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.433" end="01:04:49.233" style="s2">banquet yesterday. Do I need to list it</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.133" end="01:04:50.933" style="s2">all out for you one by one?</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:53.233" style="s2">Now get back to your room and reflect.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.933" end="01:04:55.733" style="s2">Don&#39;t come out without my permission.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.233" end="01:04:57.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mom just speaks her mind. She</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.733" end="01:04:59.133" style="s2">didn&#39;t mean to say all that. Just</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.133" end="01:05:01.833" style="s2">forgive her this once.</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.133" end="01:05:02.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eve, please don&#39;t take my mom seriously.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.833" end="01:05:04.533" style="s2">She was just worried about the Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.933" end="01:05:06.333" style="s2">family holdings. That&#39;s why she spoke</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.533" end="01:05:07.933" style="s2">out of turn. You know how it is. After</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.333" end="01:05:08.433" style="s2">all, you did that kind of thing back</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.933" end="01:05:10.033" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.433" end="01:05:14.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a lie.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.033" end="01:05:14.133" style="s2">It&#39;s your mom bullying my mom.</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.133" end="01:05:18.933" style="s2">Ew, you&#39;re all bad people.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.333" end="01:05:23.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just like your mother, all of</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.735" end="01:05:26.935" style="s2">you. Get back to your rooms and stay</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.335" end="01:05:26.935" style="s2">there. Nobody comes out today.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:35.435" style="s2">This is a photo of Diane sneaking into</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.535" end="01:05:35.435" style="s2">the lab back then.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.835" end="01:05:38.935" style="s2">Eve.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.335" end="01:05:41.535" style="s2">Back then I thought you leaked the core</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.935" end="01:05:42.835" style="s2">secrets, but just days ago Grant found</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.535" end="01:05:44.935" style="s2">the backup surveillance footage from the</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.835" end="01:05:46.935" style="s2">lab door. Only then did I learn it was</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.935" end="01:05:47.435" style="s2">Diane who secretly copied the files all</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.935" end="01:05:49.035" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.435" end="01:05:50.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was the one who had Lulu put that</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.035" end="01:05:51.635" style="s2">photo in the study. I never entered the</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.535" end="01:05:53.835" style="s2">lab back then. Then where did that</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.635" end="01:05:55.235" style="s2">footage come from?</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.835" end="01:05:57.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Diane pulled those surveillance tapes</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.235" end="01:05:59.435" style="s2">back then. I suspect she forged a fake</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.135" end="01:06:03.235" style="s2">tape in advance to make us think it was</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.435" end="01:06:03.235" style="s2">you. I&#39;m sorry, Evie.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.435" end="01:06:07.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The key now is to gather more evidence.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.535" end="01:06:08.735" style="s2">What have Diane and Audrey been sneaking</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.135" end="01:06:10.035" style="s2">around doing lately?</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.735" end="01:06:11.835" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid they&#39;ll go after Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.035" end="01:06:13.435" style="s2">Group.</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.835" end="01:06:14.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How would they dare go after Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.435" end="01:06:16.135" style="s2">Group?</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.635" end="01:06:17.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These past few days they&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.135" end="01:06:19.835" style="s2">drugging your tea, too. I&#39;m worried they</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.935" end="01:06:21.435" style="s2">want to sideline you and swallow Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.835" end="01:06:23.535" style="s2">Group whole.</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.435" end="01:06:25.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mother and daughter have some nerve</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.535" end="01:06:26.235" style="s2">daring to pull such dirty tricks right</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.335" end="01:06:28.635" style="s2">under my nose.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.235" end="01:06:30.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll have people</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.635" end="01:06:31.935" style="s2">watching Diane and her daughter the</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.035" end="01:06:35.135" style="s2">moment they move on Beckett Group. I</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.935" end="01:06:36.835" style="s2">won&#39;t let them get away with it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.135" end="01:06:38.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once the truth is out</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.835" end="01:06:42.535" style="s2">the Becketts will clear your name.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.935" end="01:06:42.535" style="s2">You&#39;ve had it rough all these years.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.135" end="01:06:48.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, Daddy, what are you talking</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.235" end="01:06:50.235" style="s2">about? Lulu&#39;s been waiting forever.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.935" end="01:06:52.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy and Daddy are talking grown-up</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.235" end="01:06:55.235" style="s2">stuff with Grandpa, so it took a while.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.235" end="01:06:57.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grown-up stuff is so complicated. Lulu</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.235" end="01:06:59.035" style="s2">only needs to think about Mommy and</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.135" end="01:07:01.235" style="s2">Daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.035" end="01:07:02.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re such a clever little thing.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.235" end="01:07:04.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you have to go to the office</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.435" end="01:07:06.135" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.035" end="01:07:08.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No important meetings today, so I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.135" end="01:07:10.135" style="s2">stay home and keep you company.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.635" end="01:07:11.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who wants your company? I can take care</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.135" end="01:07:14.435" style="s2">of Lulu myself.</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.335" end="01:07:18.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu wants to go to the amusement park.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.435" end="01:07:20.735" style="s2">Lulu wants to eat a big pizza.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.635" end="01:07:23.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then today mom and dad will play with</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.735" end="01:07:23.135" style="s2">Lulu.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.835" end="01:07:25.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu wants</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.636" end="01:07:27.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to ride this.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.836" end="01:07:28.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This thing swings way too hard. Aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.536" end="01:07:30.136" style="s2">you scared, Lulu?</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.336" end="01:07:33.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re there. Don&#39;t be scared. Lulu</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.136" end="01:07:33.936" style="s2">wants to play with mom and dad.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.536" end="01:07:38.836" style="s2">Next, Lulu wants to ride the carousel.</p>
<p begin="01:07:47.836" end="01:07:53.736" style="s2">Daddy, Lulu&#39;s hungry.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.436" end="01:07:53.736" style="s2">Lulu wants pizza.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.536" end="01:08:02.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a bit hot. Be careful when you eat,</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.336" end="01:08:02.736" style="s2">Lulu.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.836" end="01:08:06.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let Lulu eat too much. We made</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.636" end="01:08:07.636" style="s2">sweet and sour spare ribs for Lulu at</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.436" end="01:08:08.036" style="s2">home tonight, waiting for her to come</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.636" end="01:08:11.636" style="s2">back and eat.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.036" end="01:08:11.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, dad. Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.336" end="01:08:19.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, mom, dad, look so pretty.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.936" end="01:08:20.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me hold Lulu.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.336" end="01:08:22.736" style="s2">Take a break.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.736" end="01:08:24.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think that little of your man I can</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.736" end="01:08:26.736" style="s2">carry too.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.436" end="01:08:26.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.736" end="01:08:32.636" style="s2">Put me down, Grant. There are too many</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.036" end="01:08:35.136" style="s2">people here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.636" end="01:08:36.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, still worried I&#39;ll get tired?</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.136" end="01:08:40.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.436" end="01:08:40.536" style="s2">Not anymore. Now put me down.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.936" end="01:08:44.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is probably the life I&#39;ve always</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.536" end="01:08:44.936" style="s2">wanted.</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.536" end="01:08:49.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sweet and sour ribs are keeping warm</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.236" end="01:08:51.636" style="s2">in the kitchen. When Lulu wakes up,</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.936" end="01:08:53.236" style="s2">we&#39;ll heat them up for her. Now hurry</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.636" end="01:08:55.236" style="s2">and carry the kids up to rest.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.236" end="01:08:57.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This man, he seems different from</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.236" end="01:08:57.736" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.036" end="01:09:10.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years raising Lulu alone, you</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.736" end="01:09:12.536" style="s2">must have suffered so much.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.536" end="01:09:13.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu&#39;s a good girl. It wasn&#39;t too hard.</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.536" end="01:09:15.636" style="s2">It&#39;s just that when she was little, she</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.936" end="01:09:17.236" style="s2">kept asking why daddy wasn&#39;t around.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.636" end="01:09:17.536" style="s2">Back then, I didn&#39;t know how to tell</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.236" end="01:09:19.436" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.536" end="01:09:20.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my fault. I missed so many years</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.436" end="01:09:22.436" style="s2">with you two. I&#39;ll get to the bottom of</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.836" end="01:09:24.336" style="s2">what happened back then and clear your</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.436" end="01:09:25.438" style="s2">name. Please, let me make it up to you</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.336" end="01:09:26.038" style="s2">both.</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.438" end="01:09:27.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.038" end="01:09:29.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You,</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.137" end="01:09:31.838" style="s2">you&#39;re really willing to forgive me?</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.737" end="01:09:34.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I say it already? As long as the</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.838" end="01:09:36.538" style="s2">truth comes out, I won&#39;t hold the past</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.038" end="01:09:36.538" style="s2">against you.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.838" end="01:09:40.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you, Evie.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.438" end="01:09:42.137" style="s2">Thank you for giving me another chance.</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.338" end="01:09:44.038" style="s2">I&#39;ll never let you and Lulu suffer</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.137" end="01:09:45.237" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.038" end="01:09:47.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.237" end="01:09:49.637" style="s2">Eve did something like that back then,</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.438" end="01:09:54.137" style="s2">and Grant still accepts her. So why</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.637" end="01:09:54.137" style="s2">can&#39;t I? How am I any less than Eve?</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.637" end="01:09:58.838" style="s2">Tomorrow, once Grant and Eve leave, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.137" end="01:10:01.137" style="s2">pretend to open the back garden gate and</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.838" end="01:10:03.637" style="s2">let her run out on her own. When Eve and</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.137" end="01:10:05.338" style="s2">Grant find out, they&#39;ll panic.</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.637" end="01:10:07.238" style="s2">Then I can transfer Beckett Group shares</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.338" end="01:10:09.738" style="s2">without anyone knowing.</p>
<p begin="01:10:07.238" end="01:10:12.038" style="s2">Eve, I&#39;m the only woman who belongs in</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.738" end="01:10:14.738" style="s2">the Beckett family, not the Becketts,</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.038" end="01:10:14.738" style="s2">not Grant.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.137" end="01:10:20.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong, Grant? What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.637" end="01:10:21.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a glitch in the company system.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.438" end="01:10:23.038" style="s2">I have to get over there.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.738" end="01:10:24.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come with you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.038" end="01:10:27.738" style="s2">I know the Beckett Group systems well.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.637" end="01:10:27.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, let&#39;s go together.</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.137" end="01:10:31.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.438" end="01:10:33.438" style="s2">Once I get Grant and Eve out of the way,</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.637" end="01:10:35.637" style="s2">that little girl will be no problem. But</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.438" end="01:10:38.738" style="s2">Russell&#39;s still here. We need to move</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.637" end="01:10:38.738" style="s2">while he&#39;s not looking.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.137" end="01:10:47.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, try this freshly steamed sweet</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.637" end="01:10:48.038" style="s2">bun. It&#39;s so sweet. Grandma will feed</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.637" end="01:10:50.438" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.038" end="01:10:52.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu, auntie will feed you. This is so</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.438" end="01:10:52.838" style="s2">yummy.</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.038" end="01:11:00.137" style="s2">Dad, what happened before was all a</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.838" end="01:11:02.038" style="s2">misunderstanding. We apologize. Please</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.137" end="01:11:03.338" style="s2">don&#39;t hold it against us. Lulu told me</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.038" end="01:11:04.538" style="s2">you haven&#39;t been feeling well lately.</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.338" end="01:11:08.137" style="s2">This is the herbal medicine I brewed.</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.538" end="01:11:08.137" style="s2">You&#39;ll feel better once you drink it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.538" end="01:11:13.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s good that you realize your</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.738" end="01:11:16.637" style="s2">mistakes. Lulu is just a child. Don&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.338" end="01:11:16.637" style="s2">so hostile toward her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.438" end="01:11:22.938" style="s2">Grandpa&#39;s a little tired. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.137" end="01:11:24.338" style="s2">my room to rest. Lulu, after you finish</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.938" end="01:11:26.438" style="s2">eating, go play by yourself for a bit.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.338" end="01:11:27.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Grandpa. Lulu will be a</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.438" end="01:11:30.439" style="s2">good girl.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.738" end="01:11:32.339" style="s2">I won&#39;t run around.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.439" end="01:11:33.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look how weak you&#39;ve been lately. Go lie</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.339" end="01:11:36.039" style="s2">down in your room for a bit. I&#39;ll keep</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.939" end="01:11:38.439" style="s2">an eye on Lulu. Nothing will happen to</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.039" end="01:11:38.439" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.239" end="01:11:44.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Auntie and grandma are up to no good</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.039" end="01:11:47.339" style="s2">again. They want to trick Lulu into</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.439" end="01:11:49.439" style="s2">going out and getting lost. Hmm, Lulu&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.339" end="01:11:51.639" style="s2">not falling for that. Lulu&#39;s got to find</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.439" end="01:11:53.839" style="s2">a good hiding spot first. Wait till mom</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.639" end="01:11:55.739" style="s2">and dad get back.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.839" end="01:11:58.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like Lucy has already run off.</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.739" end="01:11:59.239" style="s2">Let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.339" end="01:12:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.239" end="01:12:02.239" style="s2">She didn&#39;t run out.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.739" end="01:12:03.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was sitting right here a moment ago.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.239" end="01:12:05.539" style="s2">How did she vanish in the blink of an</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.439" end="01:12:07.039" style="s2">eye?</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.539" end="01:12:09.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could she have run off to find Russell?</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.039" end="01:12:11.039" style="s2">No, that can&#39;t be. Russell is still</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.639" end="01:12:12.839" style="s2">lying in his room.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.039" end="01:12:14.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It took us all day to get Eve and Grant</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.839" end="01:12:15.539" style="s2">out of the way, and now the girl&#39;s gone</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.539" end="01:12:17.739" style="s2">and vanished.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.539" end="01:12:18.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do now? Such a good chance</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.739" end="01:12:20.039" style="s2">wasted.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.239" end="01:12:21.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can run, but you can&#39;t hide forever.</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.039" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">Where can a five-year-old girl possibly</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.739" end="01:12:25.939" style="s2">go? Let&#39;s search right now. We have to</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.539" end="01:12:27.739" style="s2">find her. Anyway, Eve and Grant aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.939" end="01:12:31.139" style="s2">here right now, and Russell is lying in</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.739" end="01:12:31.139" style="s2">bed. No one will find out.</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.639" end="01:12:39.739" style="s2">Damn it. Where did that damn girl run</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.539" end="01:12:41.239" style="s2">off to? She really ruined my plan.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.739" end="01:12:43.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t already run out, did she?</p>
<p begin="01:12:41.239" end="01:12:44.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. The door&#39;s still ajar. Lucy</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.339" end="01:12:47.239" style="s2">couldn&#39;t possibly have run off. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:12:44.739" end="01:12:47.239" style="s2">keep looking.</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.639" end="01:12:55.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Audrey, I&#39;ve searched the whole garden.</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.039" end="01:12:55.839" style="s2">Can&#39;t find her.</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.939" end="01:13:00.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t we still not checked inside the</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.439" end="01:13:02.839" style="s2">house? What if Lucy ran into the house?</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.339" end="01:13:02.839" style="s2">Keep looking.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.139" end="01:13:10.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re done for. Lucy is nowhere to be</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.239" end="01:13:12.039" style="s2">found. When Grant gets back, he</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.739" end="01:13:14.139" style="s2">definitely won&#39;t let us off.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.039" end="01:13:15.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way, right? She&#39;s just a</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.139" end="01:13:18.039" style="s2">five-year-old kid. How could grown</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.839" end="01:13:19.539" style="s2">adults like us lose her?</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.039" end="01:13:21.539" style="s2">Maybe one of the maids thought she was</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.539" end="01:13:23.839" style="s2">cute and took her to play in another</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.539" end="01:13:23.839" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.270" end="01:13:25.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.439" end="01:13:27.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.339" end="01:13:28.539" style="s2">When we came in, all the maids were sent</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.339" end="01:13:30.640" style="s2">to the front yard to tend the flower</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.539" end="01:13:33.240" style="s2">beds. The whole first floor, it&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.640" end="01:13:33.240" style="s2">the two of us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.940" end="01:13:36.840" style="s2">Could it be?</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.240" end="01:13:39.540" style="s2">Could Russell have woken up and taken</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.840" end="01:13:39.540" style="s2">Lulu away?</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.340" end="01:13:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.440" end="01:13:47.040" style="s2">Russell should be sleeping like a rock.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.240" end="01:13:51.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Russell really woke up</p>
<p begin="01:13:49.440" end="01:13:54.740" style="s2">and found out our plan,</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.540" end="01:13:54.740" style="s2">then it&#39;s all over for us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.740" end="01:14:02.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go check, quick. If Russell&#39;s awake and</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.940" end="01:14:02.840" style="s2">notices something&#39;s off, we&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.226" end="01:14:06.246" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.240" end="01:14:13.340" style="s2">It&#39;s fine. Russell&#39;s still asleep.</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.540" end="01:14:15.740" style="s2">The door&#39;s locked from inside. He never</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.340" end="01:14:15.740" style="s2">came out.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.040" end="01:14:25.640" style="s2">It&#39;s Grant and Eve. They&#39;re back. What</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.140" end="01:14:25.640" style="s2">do we do? What do we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.540" end="01:14:32.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why panic? Just say we don&#39;t know where</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.840" end="01:14:34.540" style="s2">Lucy went. Russell&#39;s still asleep in his</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.640" end="01:14:37.640" style="s2">room. We were just looking for her, too.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.540" end="01:14:37.640" style="s2">Who&#39;d suspect us?</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.040" end="01:14:48.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Lulu? Why don&#39;t I see Lulu?</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.740" end="01:14:50.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu is just downstairs eating sweet</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.540" end="01:14:52.240" style="s2">buns. I even said I&#39;d take her to the</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.440" end="01:14:54.440" style="s2">back garden to see the bunnies. Then I</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.240" end="01:14:57.140" style="s2">turned around and she was gone.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.440" end="01:14:59.140" style="s2">Mom and I were just about to tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.140" end="01:15:01.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu&#39;s missing? How could Lulu be</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.140" end="01:15:01.640" style="s2">missing?</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.540" end="01:15:07.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you last see Lulu?</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.540" end="01:15:09.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right in the back garden, by the</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.040" end="01:15:09.340" style="s2">rockery.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.540" end="01:15:12.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lock down the estate right now. Every</p>
<p begin="01:15:11.240" end="01:15:13.740" style="s2">entrance and exit. Pull up all of</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.540" end="01:15:16.840" style="s2">today&#39;s security footage. Everyone</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.740" end="01:15:18.140" style="s2">search. Not 1 in left unchecked.</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.840" end="01:15:20.340" style="s2">Don&#39;t panic.</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.140" end="01:15:21.440" style="s2">Lulu must still be in the house. Nothing</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.340" end="01:15:23.540" style="s2">bad will happen.</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.440" end="01:15:26.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu has always been such a good girl.</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.540" end="01:15:26.640" style="s2">How could she just wander off?</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.040" end="01:15:31.840" style="s2">Lulu never wanders off. Did you two hide</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.140" end="01:15:31.840" style="s2">Lulu somewhere?</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.040" end="01:15:36.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never even saw Lulu. How could I be</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.242" end="01:15:37.442" style="s2">the one who lost her? Don&#39;t you dare</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.142" end="01:15:38.542" style="s2">throw baseless accusations.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.442" end="01:15:40.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe the kid was just playing and</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.542" end="01:15:42.542" style="s2">wandered off somewhere. She&#39;ll come out</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.942" end="01:15:43.542" style="s2">once she&#39;s done playing. No need to</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.542" end="01:15:45.342" style="s2">check the cameras.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.542" end="01:15:46.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett, we&#39;ve searched the backyard</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.342" end="01:15:48.142" style="s2">and the front yard. No sign of the</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.742" end="01:15:49.042" style="s2">little miss. Only the orchard on the</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.142" end="01:15:50.542" style="s2">back hill is left.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.042" end="01:15:51.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The back hill is huge and full of trees.</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.542" end="01:15:53.442" style="s2">Could a little kid have run up there and</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.942" end="01:15:57.042" style="s2">gotten lost?</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.442" end="01:15:57.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go to the back hill.</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.242" end="01:16:02.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant,</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.342" end="01:16:03.942" style="s2">listen. Is that a sound from the storage</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.842" end="01:16:06.342" style="s2">room?</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.942" end="01:16:06.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.042" end="01:16:09.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu,</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.142" end="01:16:12.042" style="s2">what are you doing hiding here? Did they</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.642" end="01:16:12.042" style="s2">scare you?</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.742" end="01:16:22.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu heard auntie and grandma talking.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.042" end="01:16:25.242" style="s2">They opened the gate and wanted Lulu to</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.442" end="01:16:27.142" style="s2">run out by herself.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.242" end="01:16:30.242" style="s2">Lulu&#39;s not dumb.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.142" end="01:16:31.742" style="s2">So Lulu hid here secretly. Mommy, isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.242" end="01:16:33.742" style="s2">Lulu super smart?</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.742" end="01:16:35.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You opened the gate on purpose, hoping</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.742" end="01:16:38.242" style="s2">Lulu would walk out. Was that to make us</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.442" end="01:16:40.842" style="s2">worry? What are you two really up to?</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.242" end="01:16:42.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Grant. This is a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.842" end="01:16:44.042" style="s2">We didn&#39;t mean that. The kid just ran</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.642" end="01:16:44.542" style="s2">off on her own. It has nothing to do</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.042" end="01:16:47.642" style="s2">with us.</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.542" end="01:16:48.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grant, believe me. It&#39;s really not what</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.642" end="01:16:51.142" style="s2">you think.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.742" end="01:16:52.742" style="s2">How could I ever hurt Lulu? I never once</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.142" end="01:16:54.742" style="s2">thought of hurting her.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.742" end="01:16:57.142" style="s2">It&#39;s Eve. Eve must have taught the kid</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.742" end="01:16:57.142" style="s2">to lie.</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.242" end="01:17:03.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guards, take these two to the guest room</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.642" end="01:17:05.842" style="s2">and keep a close watch on them. Without</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.642" end="01:17:08.042" style="s2">my permission, not a single step out of</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.842" end="01:17:08.042" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.342" end="01:17:15.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do it. I don&#39;t know anything.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.142" end="01:17:16.742" style="s2">Grant, you have no right to treat me</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.542" end="01:17:19.342" style="s2">like this.</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.742" end="01:17:20.642" style="s2">I&#39;m the Beckett matriarch.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.342" end="01:17:22.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy,</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.642" end="01:17:24.942" style="s2">Lulu wants to stay with mommy and daddy</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.842" end="01:17:26.442" style="s2">forever. Lulu doesn&#39;t want to be apart</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.942" end="01:17:28.242" style="s2">from you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.442" end="01:17:30.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu will definitely always be with</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.242" end="01:17:30.942" style="s2">mommy and daddy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.542" end="01:17:36.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take those two away.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.043" end="01:17:41.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy&#39;s here, Lulu. Don&#39;t be scared. The</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.743" end="01:17:44.243" style="s2">bad people are gone.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.743" end="01:17:47.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lulu&#39;s not scared. Lulu will protect</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.243" end="01:17:49.743" style="s2">Mommy, too. Lulu will protect Mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.343" end="01:17:53.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our Lulu is very brave. Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.743" end="01:17:53.343" style="s2">Where&#39;s Grandpa? Where is he?</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.743" end="01:17:57.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa&#39;s asleep again.</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.443" end="01:18:13.743" style="s2">Grandpa, Grandpa, wake up. Lulu&#39;s here</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.543" end="01:18:15.343" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.743" end="01:18:17.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dr. Bell, get to the old house right</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.343" end="01:18:19.943" style="s2">away. My dad won&#39;t wake up no matter how</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.043" end="01:18:22.143" style="s2">we call him. He won&#39;t wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.943" end="01:18:24.543" style="s2">Don&#39;t be scared, Lulu. Grandpa will be</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.143" end="01:18:24.543" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.743" end="01:18:30.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Beckett, your father was given a</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.243" end="01:18:32.543" style="s2">small dose of sedatives. Once it wears</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.243" end="01:18:34.443" style="s2">off, he&#39;ll be fine. He&#39;s just frail. He</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.543" end="01:18:36.143" style="s2">needs some rest.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.443" end="01:18:38.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Dr. Bell. I&#39;ll have someone</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.143" end="01:18:38.843" style="s2">drive you back.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.343" end="01:18:45.543" style="s2">Dad, are you feeling better?</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.543" end="01:18:47.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This morning, I don&#39;t know what</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.543" end="01:18:47.843" style="s2">happened. After eating, I felt drowsy</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.243" end="01:18:50.043" style="s2">and wanted to sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.843" end="01:18:52.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I slept until now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.043" end="01:18:55.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandpa&#39;s gone. Someone tried to take</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.143" end="01:18:57.343" style="s2">Lulu, but Lulu was smart and hid.</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.843" end="01:19:00.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on, Grant?</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.343" end="01:19:03.143" style="s2">Tell me what exactly happened.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.343" end="01:19:03.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.343" end="01:19:07.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those vicious mother and daughter dared</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.343" end="01:19:09.543" style="s2">to do something this heinous to the</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.743" end="01:19:12.043" style="s2">Becketts. I won&#39;t let them get away with</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.543" end="01:19:13.843" style="s2">it. I must have been blind, raising two</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.043" end="01:19:16.143" style="s2">ungrateful wretches like them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.843" end="01:19:17.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Diane has been with me for decades, and</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.143" end="01:19:19.143" style="s2">I never once saw her true face. And</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.843" end="01:19:19.543" style="s2">Audrey, I doted on her for over 10</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.143" end="01:19:22.443" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.543" end="01:19:24.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;d even go after a 5-year-old child.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.443" end="01:19:25.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t worry. They&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.743" end="01:19:27.343" style="s2">restrained.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.943" end="01:19:28.343" style="s2">However you want to handle it, it&#39;s up</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.343" end="01:19:30.343" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.343" end="01:19:31.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t settle this privately, and we</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.343" end="01:19:33.943" style="s2">can&#39;t just lock them up and be done with</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.743" end="01:19:35.543" style="s2">it. Those two are far too scheming. Keep</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.943" end="01:19:37.343" style="s2">them around, and they&#39;ll hurt someone</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.543" end="01:19:39.045" style="s2">again. And the Beckett group&#39;s assets</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.343" end="01:19:41.045" style="s2">they secretly moved before, that gets</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.045" end="01:19:42.844" style="s2">investigated too. Dig up every dirty</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.045" end="01:19:43.445" style="s2">account. Not a single cent should be</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.844" end="01:19:45.545" style="s2">spared.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.445" end="01:19:47.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, that&#39;s exactly what I was thinking.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.545" end="01:19:49.144" style="s2">Call all the Becket&#39;s over and let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.344" end="01:19:52.045" style="s2">clear up the truth from back then.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.144" end="01:19:52.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever you say.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.744" end="01:19:59.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russell, why are you only waking up now?</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.045" end="01:20:02.545" style="s2">You don&#39;t know. While you were gone,</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.644" end="01:20:04.144" style="s2">Grant, he beat and cursed us</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.545" end="01:20:06.744" style="s2">and locked us up.</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.144" end="01:20:07.744" style="s2">You have to stand up for us.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.744" end="01:20:10.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.744" end="01:20:13.644" style="s2">Grant locked us up without even asking.</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.344" end="01:20:13.644" style="s2">You have to believe us.</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.744" end="01:20:24.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.045" end="01:20:27.045" style="s2">Even now you&#39;re still spouting nonsense,</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.744" end="01:20:28.545" style="s2">twisting the truth. Let me ask you, when</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.045" end="01:20:30.445" style="s2">you drugged me, did you think today</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.545" end="01:20:32.244" style="s2">would come? You and Audrey plotted to</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.445" end="01:20:32.945" style="s2">drive Lulu out. Did you think today</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.244" end="01:20:35.144" style="s2">would come?</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.945" end="01:20:37.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does Russell know I drugged him?</p>
<p begin="01:20:35.144" end="01:20:39.644" style="s2">Could it be? Could he know everything?</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.945" end="01:20:42.244" style="s2">I&#39;ve served you for over 10 years and</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.644" end="01:20:44.244" style="s2">you still slander me. Russell, do you</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.244" end="01:20:46.045" style="s2">even have a heart? I&#39;ve been nothing but</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.244" end="01:20:46.545" style="s2">loyal to you. How could you do this to</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.045" end="01:20:49.045" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.545" end="01:20:50.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you can&#39;t treat mom like this. What</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.045" end="01:20:52.945" style="s2">happened today has nothing to do with</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.644" end="01:20:54.244" style="s2">us. Dad, you have to believe us. I just</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.945" end="01:20:57.144" style="s2">opened the door and forgot to close it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.244" end="01:20:58.344" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do anything.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.144" end="01:21:00.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like you won&#39;t talk till you see</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.344" end="01:21:00.945" style="s2">the coffin.</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.545" end="01:21:05.644" style="s2">The cameras clearly show you</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.644" end="01:21:07.744" style="s2">deliberately opening the courtyard gate.</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.644" end="01:21:10.744" style="s2">What do you have to say for yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.744" end="01:21:11.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I was just it&#39;s because</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.744" end="01:21:13.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really can&#39;t believe this. You</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.744" end="01:21:14.644" style="s2">actually opened the gate on purpose to</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.144" end="01:21:16.344" style="s2">make the child run off and get lost.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.644" end="01:21:20.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mother and daughter are so vicious,</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.344" end="01:21:20.144" style="s2">not even sparing a 5-year-old child.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.945" end="01:21:27.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russell, I&#39;ve been with you all these</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.844" end="01:21:28.844" style="s2">years. Even if I haven&#39;t earned merit,</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.144" end="01:21:30.445" style="s2">I&#39;ve put in the hard work. I just lost</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.844" end="01:21:31.244" style="s2">my head for a moment. Please let me off</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.445" end="01:21:33.445" style="s2">this once. Okay?</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.244" end="01:21:35.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s if you pocketed through me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.445" end="01:21:36.945" style="s2">All these years, haven&#39;t I always given</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.244" end="01:21:38.744" style="s2">you and Audrey the best of everything?</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.945" end="01:21:40.945" style="s2">Food, clothes, everything you use. When</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.744" end="01:21:42.646" style="s2">did I ever shortchange you? But you two</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.945" end="01:21:43.745" style="s2">secretly harboring vicious ambitions,</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.646" end="01:21:45.146" style="s2">not only coveting the Beckett family</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.745" end="01:21:47.046" style="s2">holdings, you even dared to scheme</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.146" end="01:21:48.745" style="s2">against my granddaughter. When I lost my</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.046" end="01:21:51.046" style="s2">head and you want to wipe out all your</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.745" end="01:21:53.046" style="s2">crimes, what a pipe dream.</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.046" end="01:21:54.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, mom has given so much to the</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.046" end="01:21:55.745" style="s2">Becketts all these years. Even if she</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.546" end="01:21:57.345" style="s2">hasn&#39;t earned merit, she&#39;s put in the</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.745" end="01:21:59.345" style="s2">hard work. Please just forgive us this</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.345" end="01:22:02.146" style="s2">once. We&#39;ll definitely change from now</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.345" end="01:22:03.845" style="s2">on. We&#39;ll definitely be better people.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.146" end="01:22:05.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over for you and you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.845" end="01:22:06.845" style="s2">making excuses.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.546" end="01:22:09.646" style="s2">The person who leaked Beckett Group&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.845" end="01:22:11.745" style="s2">core secrets back then was never me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:09.646" end="01:22:13.546" style="s2">I have backup surveillance footage and</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.745" end="01:22:15.546" style="s2">photos of Diane drugging me and framing</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.546" end="01:22:16.546" style="s2">me back then. Back then, Diane pretended</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.546" end="01:22:17.946" style="s2">to be friendly.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.546" end="01:22:19.845" style="s2">After I drank the juice she gave me, I</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.946" end="01:22:22.245" style="s2">passed out. When I woke up, all the</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.845" end="01:22:23.745" style="s2">evidence pointed at me. I was branded a</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.245" end="01:22:25.845" style="s2">leaker for nothing and pushed to the</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.745" end="01:22:27.946" style="s2">brink. These recordings and photos are</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.845" end="01:22:29.446" style="s2">all ironclad proof of what happened,</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.946" end="01:22:30.946" style="s2">enough to clear every false charge</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.446" end="01:22:32.845" style="s2">against me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.946" end="01:22:34.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about what happened back then? Eve</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.845" end="01:22:37.546" style="s2">was set up and framed from the very</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.345" end="01:22:38.745" style="s2">start. None of it was her fault. I was a</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.546" end="01:22:40.146" style="s2">fool.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.745" end="01:22:41.046" style="s2">I didn&#39;t look into it and wrongly blamed</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.146" end="01:22:44.146" style="s2">Eve.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.046" end="01:22:45.845" style="s2">Right here, I apologize to Eve.</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.146" end="01:22:47.146" style="s2">And these are all the proof that you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.845" end="01:22:49.245" style="s2">been secretly moving the Beckett family</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.146" end="01:22:51.345" style="s2">assets for years, drugging the old man,</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.245" end="01:22:53.745" style="s2">scheming to destroy Eve. The evidence is</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.345" end="01:22:56.546" style="s2">conclusive. Now, what do you have to say</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.745" end="01:22:56.546" style="s2">for yourselves?</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.245" end="01:23:04.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, so what if I did it? So what? All</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.946" end="01:23:06.646" style="s2">these years I slaved away in this house.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.745" end="01:23:07.745" style="s2">I never got a single benefit. Audrey</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.646" end="01:23:09.245" style="s2">should have been the rightful Beckett</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.745" end="01:23:10.845" style="s2">heiress. Why does everything go to them</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.245" end="01:23:13.446" style="s2">the moment Eve comes back? I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.845" end="01:23:14.546" style="s2">accept it. I just can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.446" end="01:23:16.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.546" end="01:23:19.146" style="s2">I&#39;ve been with you all these years. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.745" end="01:23:21.546" style="s2">done whatever you said.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.146" end="01:23:23.946" style="s2">I just love Grant. I just want to be the</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.546" end="01:23:25.245" style="s2">Beckett matriarch. Is that wrong? How am</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.946" end="01:23:26.245" style="s2">I any less than Eve?</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.245" end="01:23:28.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Diane,</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.245" end="01:23:30.245" style="s2">you framed Eve. You forged evidence of a</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.646" end="01:23:31.546" style="s2">leak, drove her to the brink until she</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.245" end="01:23:32.845" style="s2">jumped into the sea, and you secretly</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.546" end="01:23:34.946" style="s2">drugged me, coveting the Beckett family</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.845" end="01:23:36.845" style="s2">holdings. From now on, you won&#39;t get a</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.946" end="01:23:38.745" style="s2">single cent of the Beckett fortune. And</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.845" end="01:23:40.245" style="s2">Audrey, you teamed up with Diane to</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.745" end="01:23:41.446" style="s2">frame Eve, leaked company secrets, and</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.245" end="01:23:43.147" style="s2">made her take the blame and the public</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.446" end="01:23:47.047" style="s2">scorn. She nearly died at sea. You</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.147" end="01:23:47.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; two must answer for this in court.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.147" end="01:23:50.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. No, Dad. How could you do this to</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.047" end="01:23:52.247" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.847" end="01:23:53.947" style="s2">I&#39;m your daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.247" end="01:23:55.247" style="s2">You raised me for over 10 years. How</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.947" end="01:23:57.347" style="s2">could you do this to me?</p>
<p begin="01:23:55.247" end="01:23:58.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the day I took you in, I never short</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.347" end="01:24:01.047" style="s2">changed you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.547" end="01:24:03.047" style="s2">Food, clothes, everything. Wasn&#39;t it all</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.047" end="01:24:05.147" style="s2">the best? You can&#39;t blame anyone else.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.047" end="01:24:06.247" style="s2">It&#39;s your own greed.</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.147" end="01:24:06.647" style="s2">That brought you step by step to this</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.247" end="01:24:08.447" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.647" end="01:24:11.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take them away and keep a close watch.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.447" end="01:24:11.847" style="s2">Deal with it when the lawyer arrives.</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.147" end="01:24:21.147" style="s2">You handle the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.147" end="01:24:28.047" style="s2">Those transferred assets, recover</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.947" end="01:24:29.847" style="s2">whatever you can. If we can&#39;t get it</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.047" end="01:24:32.147" style="s2">back, consider it my payoff to them</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.847" end="01:24:34.547" style="s2">after all these years.</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.147" end="01:24:36.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t get too worked up. Your</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.547" end="01:24:38.347" style="s2">health matters most. Leave the rest to</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.647" end="01:24:40.347" style="s2">me. Get some good rest.</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.347" end="01:24:42.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let Lulu rest well at home.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.347" end="01:24:44.347" style="s2">That child has been wronged. In a couple</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.547" end="01:24:45.547" style="s2">of days, when I&#39;m feeling better, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.347" end="01:24:47.947" style="s2">take her to buy the sweet buns she</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.547" end="01:24:47.947" style="s2">loves.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.547" end="01:24:58.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Handle Diane and Audrey for me. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.747" end="01:24:58.047" style="s2">send you the evidence later.</p>
<p begin="01:25:03.547" end="01:25:07.847" style="s2">I never thought they&#39;d be this cruel.</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.547" end="01:25:10.047" style="s2">Even a little kid like Lulu, they</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.847" end="01:25:11.647" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t spare. They&#39;ll never set foot</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.047" end="01:25:13.847" style="s2">in the Beckett house again. They won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.647" end="01:25:15.647" style="s2">hurt Lulu anymore. Our family can live</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.847" end="01:25:18.347" style="s2">in peace now. Nothing like this will</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.647" end="01:25:18.347" style="s2">ever happen again.</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.347" end="01:25:24.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is our daughter a little too hyper?</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.447" end="01:25:25.947" style="s2">She&#39;s been running around all morning</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.747" end="01:25:28.047" style="s2">and still isn&#39;t tired.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.947" end="01:25:30.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Dad&#39;s been dodging Lulu these past</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.047" end="01:25:30.947" style="s2">two days. That kid&#39;s energy never runs</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.147" end="01:25:32.747" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.947" end="01:25:35.547" style="s2">Yesterday she chased Dad for three laps,</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.747" end="01:25:37.347" style="s2">left him gasping for breath.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.547" end="01:25:38.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, take care of yourself. Don&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.347" end="01:25:40.247" style="s2">playing with Lulu all the time. Your</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.847" end="01:25:40.947" style="s2">body can&#39;t take her running you ragged</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.247" end="01:25:43.047" style="s2">like that.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.947" end="01:25:44.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These old bones can still hold up.</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.047" end="01:25:47.849" style="s2">Playing with my precious granddaughter,</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.747" end="01:25:49.049" style="s2">even if I&#39;m tired, I&#39;m happy.</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.849" end="01:25:51.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we should send Lulu to</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.049" end="01:25:52.948" style="s2">kindergarten. Lulu&#39;s five now. It&#39;s time</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.349" end="01:25:55.349" style="s2">for school. Running around at home all</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.948" end="01:25:57.349" style="s2">day isn&#39;t right.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.349" end="01:25:59.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t bear to let her go. Lulu is so</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.349" end="01:26:00.649" style="s2">young. How will she eat or sleep well</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.249" end="01:26:01.749" style="s2">over there? What if other kids bully</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.649" end="01:26:02.849" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.749" end="01:26:04.149" style="s2">She&#39;s better off at home with the</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.849" end="01:26:05.349" style="s2">servants, and I get to be with my</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.149" end="01:26:06.948" style="s2">precious granddaughter every day.</p>
<p begin="01:26:05.349" end="01:26:08.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, Lulu&#39;s almost old enough.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.948" end="01:26:09.349" style="s2">Kindergarten has teachers who teach</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.049" end="01:26:12.849" style="s2">singing and drawing. She can play with</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.349" end="01:26:12.849" style="s2">other kids, too. She&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.749" end="01:26:18.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, fine. She can go.</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.549" end="01:26:19.549" style="s2">But you have to pick the best</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.049" end="01:26:21.249" style="s2">kindergarten for me. The teachers must</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.549" end="01:26:24.149" style="s2">be reliable. My precious granddaughter</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.249" end="01:26:24.149" style="s2">can&#39;t suffer a bit.</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.549" end="01:26:29.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, kindergarten doesn&#39;t allow snacks,</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.649" end="01:26:31.349" style="s2">and these toys can&#39;t be brought either.</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.649" end="01:26:32.849" style="s2">The teacher said just a backpack and</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.349" end="01:26:35.149" style="s2">water bottle.</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.849" end="01:26:37.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This kindergarten has so many rules.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.149" end="01:26:38.448" style="s2">Can&#39;t even bring snacks.</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.049" end="01:26:40.849" style="s2">What if my precious granddaughter gets</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.448" end="01:26:40.849" style="s2">hungry?</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.849" end="01:26:47.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, Daddy. Bye, Mommy. Bye-bye,</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.549" end="01:26:47.049" style="s2">Grandpa.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.349" end="01:26:53.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonder if Lulu&#39;s been crying.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.849" end="01:26:55.948" style="s2">Is she playing nice with the other kids?</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.948" end="01:26:57.948" style="s2">Will the teacher look after her?</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.948" end="01:26:59.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, let&#39;s head back first. We&#39;ll just</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.948" end="01:27:00.649" style="s2">come pick Lulu up earlier this</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.049" end="01:27:02.849" style="s2">afternoon. Peeking around here won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.649" end="01:27:04.649" style="s2">help. The teachers don&#39;t let parents</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.849" end="01:27:05.948" style="s2">linger.</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.649" end="01:27:07.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Suddenly, the house is missing a little</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.948" end="01:27:10.149" style="s2">chatterbox. It really does feel a bit</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.649" end="01:27:10.149" style="s2">strange.</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.349" end="01:27:14.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing we too can have some peace</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.649" end="01:27:16.049" style="s2">for a few days.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.549" end="01:27:18.149" style="s2">Didn&#39;t we say we wanted to vacation</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.049" end="01:27:20.948" style="s2">abroad? Once we wrap up things at the</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.149" end="01:27:24.649" style="s2">company, we&#39;ll go. Okay?</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.948" end="01:27:24.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;ve wanted to go for ages.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
